    "meaning": "根据特点分清差别。",
    "en": "distinguish by examining features",
    "paragraph": 4,
    "example": "科技的发展也让信息真假的辨别变得更加困难。"
  },
  "改头换面": {
    "meaning": "改变外表或形式，文中指修改图像原来的样子。",
    "en": "change the appearance or form; here, alter an image",
    "paragraph": 4,
    "example": "但是，如今人们却可以轻松地利用科技将图像改头换面，制造出更难分辨的虚假信息，让人更难发现事情的真相。"
  },
  "真相": {
    "meaning": "事情的真实情况。",
    "en": "the truth about what happened",
    "paragraph": 4,
    "example": "但是，如今人们却可以轻松地利用科技将图像改头换面，制造出更难分辨的虚假信息，让人更难发现事情的真相。"
  },
  "误导": {
    "meaning": "使人产生错误的认识或判断。",
    "en": "mislead someone into a wrong understanding or judgement",
    "paragraph": 5,
    "example": "假信息有很大的误导性，会让人把假的当成真的。"
  },
  "三人成虎": {
    "meaning": "多人反复传播同一说法，容易使人信以为真。",
    "en": "repeated claims by many people can make an unfounded story seem true",
    "paragraph": 5,
    "example": "有个成语“三人成虎”，来自这样一个故事。"
  },
  "信以为真": {
    "meaning": "把不真实或未证实的事情当成真的。",
    "en": "believe something false or unverified to be true",
    "paragraph": 5,
    "example": "但如果很多人都跟他这样说，他就会信以为真。"
  },
  "真伪": {
    "meaning": "真假。",
    "en": "whether something is genuine or false",
    "paragraph": 5,
    "example": "这个故事告诉我们，假信息重复的次数多了，很容易使人分不清真伪。"
  },
  "半信半疑": {
    "meaning": "有些相信，又有些怀疑。",
    "en": "half believing and half doubting",
    "paragraph": 5,
    "example": "假信息的传播，会让原本不相信的人也变得半信半疑，甚至最终落入假信息的陷阱。"
  },
  "陷阱": {
    "meaning": "文中比喻诱使人受骗的圈套。",
    "en": "a trap; here, a scheme that tricks people",
    "paragraph": 5,
    "example": "假信息的传播，会让原本不相信的人也变得半信半疑，甚至最终落入假信息的陷阱。"
  },
  "互信": {
    "meaning": "彼此信任。",
    "en": "mutual trust",
    "paragraph": 6,
    "example": "如果人们缺乏基本的互信，真诚的合作也就无从说起。"
  },
  "创新": {
    "meaning": "创造新的内容、方法或事物。",
    "en": "create new ideas, methods or things",
    "paragraph": 6,
    "example": "在一个人与人互相信任的社会，人们更容易建立合作关系，因此也更容易推动各种创新和发明。"
  },
  "无从说起": {
    "meaning": "没有条件或基础谈起这件事。",
    "en": "have no basis or conditions from which to begin",
    "paragraph": 6,
    "example": "如果人们缺乏基本的互信，真诚的合作也就无从说起。"
  },
  "步伐": {
    "meaning": "本指走路的脚步，文中比喻时代发展的进程。",
    "en": "literally, footsteps; here, the pace of development",
    "paragraph": 6,
    "example": "这样的社会很难取得进步，更无法跟上时代的步伐。"
  },
  "警觉": {
    "meaning": "对可能出现的问题保持注意。",
    "en": "remain alert to possible problems",
    "paragraph": 7,
    "example": "要减少假信息的危害，就要提高我们对假信息的警觉与辨别信息真伪的能力。"
  },
  "查证": {
    "meaning": "调查核实，取得可供判断的依据。",
    "en": "investigate and verify using evidence",
    "paragraph": 7,
    "example": "我们可以通过对信息来源的查证，确定信息是否可靠，也可以通过多方询问、比较来辨别信息的真假。"
  },
  "询问": {
    "meaning": "向别人打听情况。",
    "en": "ask someone for information",
    "paragraph": 7,
    "example": "我们可以通过对信息来源的查证，确定信息是否可靠，也可以通过多方询问、比较来辨别信息的真假。"
  },
  "人云亦云": {
    "meaning": "缺少自己的判断，别人怎么说就跟着怎么说。",
    "en": "repeat what others say without one's own judgement",
    "paragraph": 7,
    "example": "这样一来，孩子长大后才能具有独立思考的能力，而不会人云亦云，轻易受到假信息的影响。"
  },
  "独立思考": {
    "meaning": "自己根据理由与证据作出判断。",
    "en": "think independently using reasons and evidence",
    "paragraph": 7,
    "example": "这样一来，孩子长大后才能具有独立思考的能力，而不会人云亦云，轻易受到假信息的影响。"
  },
  "免疫力": {
    "meaning": "文中比喻辨别并抵抗假信息影响的能力。",
    "en": "immunity; here, the ability to recognise and resist false information",
    "paragraph": 8,
    "example": "只要我们提高对假信息的认识和警觉，就一定可以增强对假信息的免疫力，增强社会的互信与凝聚力。"
  },
  "凝聚力": {
    "meaning": "使人们团结在一起的力量。",
    "en": "the bond that unites people and encourages cooperation",
    "paragraph": 8,
    "example": "只要我们提高对假信息的认识和警觉，就一定可以增强对假信息的免疫力，增强社会的互信与凝聚力。"
  }
};
window.HWT_WORD_CONTEXT=()=>({lessonId:LESSON.id,lessonTitle:LESSON.title,grade:2,unit:6,paragraphs:LESSON.paragraphs});
window.HWT_WORD_LEXICON=()=>window.LESSON_WORDS;
</script><script>window.LESSON_CATALOG=[{"id":"s2u1l1","title":"我想对你说","grade":2,"unit":1,"aliases":[]},{"id":"s2u1l2","title":"把爱说出来","grade":2,"unit":1,"aliases":["2hcl-u1-ba-ai-shuo-chu-lai"]},{"id":"s2u1l3","title":"放风筝","grade":2,"unit":1,"aliases":["2hcl-u1-fang-feng-zheng"]},{"id":"s2u1l4","title":"母与女","grade":2,"unit":1,"aliases":[]},{"id":"s2u2l1","title":"助养野生动物","grade":2,"unit":2,"aliases":["2hcl-u2-zhu-yang-ye-sheng-dong-wu"]},{"id":"s2u2l2","title":"猫","grade":2,"unit":2,"aliases":["2hcl-u2-mao"]},{"id":"s2u2l3","title":"山中奇遇","grade":2,"unit":2,"aliases":[]},{"id":"s2u2l4","title":"珍珠鸟","grade":2,"unit":2,"aliases":[]},{"id":"s2u3l1","title":"水都去哪了","grade":2,"unit":3,"aliases":[]},{"id":"s2u3l2","title":"人类最糟糕的发明","grade":2,"unit":3,"aliases":[]},{"id":"s2u3l3","title":"手机被丢弃之后","grade":2,"unit":3,"aliases":[]},{"id":"s2u3l4","title":"狼鹿效应","grade":2,"unit":3,"aliases":[]},{"id":"s2u4l1","title":"心情手账","grade":2,"unit":4,"aliases":[]},{"id":"s2u4l2","title":"恐怖事件","grade":2,"unit":4,"aliases":[]},{"id":"s2u4l3","title":"最美的姿势","grade":2,"unit":4,"aliases":[]},{"id":"s2u4l4","title":"我与父亲的秘密","grade":2,"unit":4,"aliases":[]},{"id":"s1u1l1","title":"新老师 新同学","grade":1,"unit":1,"aliases":[]},{"id":"s1u1l2","title":"一个蛋两个蛋三个蛋","grade":1,"unit":1,"aliases":[]},{"id":"s1u1l3","title":"张老师审案","grade":1,"unit":1,"aliases":[]},{"id":"s1u1l4","title":"王几何","grade":1,"unit":1,"aliases":[]},{"id":"s1u2l1","title":"世界各地的新年风俗","grade":1,"unit":2,"aliases":[]},{"id":"s1u2l2","title":"团圆饭","grade":1,"unit":2,"aliases":[]},{"id":"s1u2l3","title":"幸运饺子","grade":1,"unit":2,"aliases":[]},{"id":"s1u2l4","title":"诗两首","grade":1,"unit":2,"aliases":[]},{"id":"s1u3l1","title":"走街串巷逛狮城","grade":1,"unit":3,"aliases":[]},{"id":"s1u3l2","title":"魅力四射 星耀樟宜","grade":1,"unit":3,"aliases":[]},{"id":"s1u3l3","title":"国家美术馆探秘","grade":1,"unit":3,"aliases":[]},{"id":"s1u3l4","title":"食在新加坡","grade":1,"unit":3,"aliases":[]},{"id":"s1u4l1","title":"培养好习惯","grade":1,"unit":4,"aliases":[]},{"id":"s1u4l2","title":"迟到","grade":1,"unit":4,"aliases":[]},{"id":"s1u4l3","title":"差不多先生","grade":1,"unit":4,"aliases":[]},{"id":"s1u4l4","title":"寓言两则","grade":1,"unit":4,"aliases":[]},{"id":"s1u5l1","title":"我是创新王","grade":1,"unit":5,"aliases":[]},{"id":"s1u5l2","title":"海底牧场游记","grade":1,"unit":5,"aliases":[]},{"id":"s1u5l3","title":"难忘的建筑之旅","grade":1,"unit":5,"aliases":[]},{"id":"s1u5l4","title":"穿越时空的采访","grade":1,"unit":5,"aliases":[]},{"id":"s1u6l1","title":"我们的无名英雄","grade":1,"unit":6,"aliases":[]},{"id":"s1u6l2","title":"我为狮城做贡献","grade":1,"unit":6,"aliases":[]},{"id":"s1u6l3","title":"小人物的心声","grade":1,"unit":6,"aliases":[]},{"id":"s1u6l4","title":"我现在要去救人","grade":1,"unit":6,"aliases":[]},{"id":"s2u5l1","title":"组屋，新加坡美丽的风景线","grade":2,"unit":5,"aliases":[]},{"id":"s2u5l2","title":"雨树","grade":2,"unit":5,"aliases":[]},{"id":"s2u5l3","title":"如果走散了","grade":2,"unit":5,"aliases":[]},{"id":"s2u6l1","title":"新加坡与世界的联系","grade":2,"unit":6,"aliases":[]},{"id":"s2u6l2","title":"多元而开放的新加坡","grade":2,"unit":6,"aliases":[]},{"id":"s2u6l3","title":"别上假信息的当","grade":2,"unit":6,"aliases":[]}];

</script><script>(()=>{
 const englishVisible=()=>window.LESSON?.wordEnglishVisible===true||(typeof DATA!=='undefined'&&DATA.wordEnglishVisible===true)||!!resolve(context().lessonId);
 const textbookEnglish={"贼\n偷窃财物的人；文中把时间比作贼，写岁月悄悄带来的变化。":"thief; here, a metaphor for time","神偷\n本领高超、让人不易察觉的小偷；文中形容时间悄悄流逝。":"an exceptionally skilful thief","青春\n年轻的时光。":"youth","岁月\n年月；经过的时间。":"the passing years","白发\n变白的头发。":"grey hair","鱼尾纹\n眼角像鱼尾形状的细小皱纹。":"crow’s feet","街市\n人们买卖东西的市场。":"market","装饰\n用来点缀、美化环境的东西。":"decorations","圣诞\n圣诞节，纪念耶稣诞生的基督教节日。":"Christmas","元旦\n公历新年的第一天，即一月一日。":"New Year’s Day","农历\n中国传统历法，农历新年按这一历法确定日期。":"the traditional Chinese calendar","农历新年\n按农历迎接新的一年的节日，也叫春节。":"Chinese New Year","悄悄\n不声张、不引人注意地。":"quietly; unnoticed","忙碌\n事情很多，没有多少空闲。":"busy","大扫除\n全面地打扫、清理环境。":"a thorough cleaning","年货\n为过年准备的食品和用品。":"New Year supplies","除夕\n农历一年最后一天的晚上。":"Chinese New Year’s Eve","团圆饭\n亲人团聚在一起吃的饭，文中指除夕的晚饭。":"a family reunion dinner","喜庆\n值得高兴和庆祝；文中形容热闹欢乐的气氛。":"festive","土气\n不时尚；文中是“我”对红色的看法。":"old-fashioned, in the narrator’s view","或许\n也许，表示不肯定。":"perhaps","定律\n原指经验证明的规律；文中用来打趣成长中想法的改变。":"a law or pattern","铁青着脸\n脸色不好看，形容不高兴或生气的神态。":"looking grim or angry","得罪\n使别人不高兴，冒犯别人。":"offend","皱着眉\n眉头蹙起，常表现烦恼、不快等情绪。":"frowning","处理\n整理、料理；文中指把鱼清理好。":"prepare or clean","年年有余\n祝愿每一年都富足、有剩余；“鱼”和“余”同音。":"a wish for abundance every year","格格不入\n彼此很不协调，不相称。":"at odds with; out of place","备用\n预先准备好，留着需要时使用。":"keep for later use","闹别扭\n因不顺心而心里不快、情绪不舒畅。":"feel upset or displeased","洋葱\n一种球状蔬菜，切开时可能刺激眼睛流泪。":"onion","嫁\n女子结婚；“嫁到英国”指结婚后到英国生活。":"marry and move to","视讯\n可以互相看见影像的视频通讯。":"video call","吞吞吐吐\n想说又不痛快地说，话语断断续续。":"speak hesitantly","假期\n不用上班、上学或执行任务的休息时间。":"leave; holiday","拜年\n在新年向亲友祝贺、问好。":"offer New Year greetings","沉默寡言\n不大说话，话很少。":"quiet and reserved","酷\n在本文中指爸爸冷静、严肃的神情，看不出明显情绪。":"a reserved expression in this context","承诺\n答应做某件事。":"promise","歉意\n认为有愧于别人而感到抱歉的心情。":"apology; regret","剃\n用刀具刮去头发或胡须等。":"shave","当兵\n参加军队服役。":"serve in the military","受训\n接受训练。":"undergo training","斗嘴\n互相争辩或拌嘴。":"bicker","冤家\n本指有仇的人；文中亲昵地指常斗嘴的哥哥姐姐。":"affectionate term for the bickering siblings here","聚头\n聚在一起，见面。":"get together","冷清\n人少、不热闹，文中也带出相聚不齐的失落。":"quiet and lonely","围炉\n家人围着火锅吃饭。":"gather around a hotpot","浪费\n不必要地消耗或丢弃东西。":"waste","火锅料\n准备放进火锅煮的食材。":"hotpot ingredients","海参\n一种可食用的海洋动物。":"sea cucumber","香菇\n一种有香味的食用菌。":"shiitake mushroom","发菜\n细长、色深、外形像头发的可食用藻类。":"fat choy","必不可少\n一定需要，不能缺少。":"essential","蒸腾\n热气、水汽等向上升起。":"steam rising","佳肴\n美味的饭菜。":"delicious dishes","美味佳肴\n味道很好的饭菜。":"delicious food","夹菜\n用筷子把菜夹起来，文中是夹给父母吃。":"serve food with chopsticks","种种\n各种各样。":"various","叽叽喳喳\n原可形容鸟叫，文中形容“我”不停说话的声音。":"chattering","冲淡\n使某种感觉减轻。":"lessen; ease","缺席\n应该或原本会参加的人没有到场。":"be absent","悦耳\n声音好听，使人愉快。":"pleasant to hear","目光\n看东西时的视线。":"gaze","投向\n把视线等转到某个方向。":"turn towards","贵宾狗\n一种狗的品种。":"poodle","期待\n盼望，希望某件事发生。":"look forward to","似乎\n好像，表示不完全确定。":"seem; appear to be, without certainty","团圆\n一家人分别后重新聚在一起。":"family reunion","体贴\n能注意到别人的处境和心情，并给予关心。":"considerate","孝顺\n关爱、尊重父母或长辈。":"filial; caring towards parents","线索\n把文章中的人物、事情等贯穿、连接起来的事物或脉络。":"thread linking the events","主题\n文章通过内容表达的主要思想或感情。":"theme","引号\n标明说话、引用等用法的一对标点符号“ ”。":"quotation marks","判决\n法院对案件作出的决定；课本例句借这个词说老师的决定。":"verdict; used figuratively in the example","春节\n农历新年的另一个名称。":"Spring Festival","福\n幸福、福气；新年常用来表达祝福。":"blessing; good fortune","助人为快乐之本\n帮助别人是获得快乐的根本。":"helping others is a source of happiness","围坐\n围成一圈坐着。":"sit together in a circle","传统\n一代代流传下来的习惯或做法。":"a custom passed down through generations","幸运\n运气好；文中也寄托美好祝愿。":"good fortune; being lucky","喜悦\n高兴、愉快。":"joy; happiness","往年\n过去的年份。":"previous years","剁\n用刀向下反复用力切。":"chop repeatedly with a knife","馅料\n包在饺子等食品里面的材料。":"the filling inside food such as dumplings","和\n这里读huó，把水加进面粉里揉拌。":"mix and knead flour with water to make dough (huó)","手巧\n手的动作灵活，做东西细致好看。":"skilful with one's hands","心想事成\n心里希望的事情能够实现。":"may your wishes come true","大吉大利\n非常吉利、顺利，用于祝福。":"may you enjoy good luck and success","记号\n为辨认事物而做的标记。":"a mark used to identify something","亲自\n自己直接去做。":"do something oneself, in person","鼓鼓的\n向外鼓起、显得饱满的样子。":"plump and bulging outwards","稍\n略微；一点点。":"slightly; a little","紧盯\n集中目光一直看着。":"keep one's eyes fixed on something","招呼\n文中指叫大家来吃饺子。":"here, call everyone over to eat","赶紧\n抓紧时间，马上行动。":"hurry and act immediately","向来\n一向；从过去到现在。":"always; as has been usual in the past","疼爱\n很爱护、关心。":"love and care for someone dearly","视力\n眼睛看清东西的能力。":"eyesight; the ability to see clearly","慈爱\n长辈对晚辈温和而充满爱。":"gentle, loving care from an elder","儿媳妇\n儿子的妻子。":"one's son's wife; daughter-in-law","照顾\n关心、照料。":"look after; take care of","感动\n因别人的关爱等而内心受到触动。":"feel emotionally touched by someone's care or actions","趁\n利用某个时机。":"take advantage of an opportunity","细心\n能留意细小的地方。":"careful and attentive to small details","感激\n因得到关心或帮助而感谢。":"feel grateful for someone's help or care","莫名其妙\n不明白其中的原因，感到奇怪。":"feel puzzled because one cannot understand the reason","疑惑\n心里不明白，有疑问。":"feel unsure or puzzled","肩膀\n手臂和身体相连接的上部。":"shoulder","亲切\n态度亲近、温和。":"warm and friendly","学业\n学习的功课和进展。":"one's studies and progress in learning","恍然大悟\n突然完全明白了。":"suddenly understand everything clearly","偷龙转凤\n本指暗中用欺骗的手法改变事物内容；文中借指姑姑悄悄把幸运饺子给“我”。":"secretly substitute one thing for another; here, pass the lucky dumpling to the narrator","可怜\n值得同情；文中爸爸是假装委屈。":"deserving sympathy; here, Father pretends to feel left out","话音刚落\n刚刚说完话。":"just as someone finishes speaking","立刻\n马上；没有耽搁。":"immediately; without delay","团聚\n家人等聚集在一起。":"come together again as a family or group","葡萄\n一种一串串生长、可以食用的果实。":"grape","象征\n用事物或动作表达某种意义。":"symbolise","事事如意\n每件事情都合乎心意。":"everything goes as wished","按照\n根据；依照。":"according to","风俗\n某个地方长期形成的生活习惯。":"custom","辞旧迎新\n告别旧的一年，迎接新的一年。":"bid farewell to the old and welcome the new","夜幕降临\n天色暗下来，夜晚到来。":"night falls","燃放\n点燃烟火等，让它燃烧或爆发。":"set off","烟火\n燃放时发出火花、光彩的物品。":"fireworks","翩翩起舞\n轻快、优美地跳舞。":"dance gracefully","瓶瓶罐罐\n各种瓶子和罐子。":"bottles and jars","去除\n除掉；去掉。":"remove","烦恼\n让人不快乐、心里不安的事情或心情。":"worry","厄运\n不幸的遭遇；坏运气。":"misfortune","前夕\n某个日子前的夜晚或前一段时间。":"eve","堆放\n把东西集中放在一起。":"pile up","预示\n事先显示某种将会出现的情况。":"indicate in advance","兆头\n预先显露的迹象。文中“好兆头”指好运的迹象。":"omen","忙碌\n事情多，忙着做事。":"busy","路途\n出行所走的路或旅程。":"journey","遥远\n距离很远。":"far away","团聚\n分开的人重新聚在一起。":"reunite","恭敬\n对人有礼貌、很尊重。":"respectful","长辈\n辈分比自己高的人。":"elder","亲戚\n和自己有血缘或婚姻关系的人。":"relative","祝福\n表达希望别人幸福、顺利的心愿。":"give good wishes","诸事大吉\n各件事情都吉利、顺利。":"good fortune in all things","魅力四射\n吸引力强，充分展现出来。":"radiating charm and appeal","休闲\n利用空闲时间休息、放松。":"resting and relaxing during free time","娱乐\n使人快乐、放松的活动。":"activities that provide enjoyment and relaxation","普通\n平常，没有特别之处。":"ordinary; not unusual","小看\n轻视；低估。":"underestimate someone's value, ability or strength","镶嵌\n把一物嵌入另一物；文中形容建筑像宝石般安放在机场旁。":"set one object into another; here, the building is described as a jewel beside the airport","横梁\n横向架着、起支撑作用的梁。":"a horizontal supporting beam","构成\n组合而形成。":"combine to form a whole; the parts making up a whole","覆盖\n盖在上面。":"cover the surface of something","特制\n为了特定需要专门制作。":"specially made for a particular purpose","独一无二\n没有完全一样的另一个；文中指每片玻璃各不相同。":"unique; no other exactly the same","量身定制\n按实际需要特别制作；文中指按玻璃所在的位置设计。":"custom-made to suit specific needs; here, each glass panel's position","瀑布\n从高处流下、像悬挂水帘的水流。":"a waterfall; water falling from a height","循环\n按一定路径反复进行。":"move repeatedly along a route or through a process","观赏\n观看并欣赏。":"look at and enjoy something beautiful","降低\n使高度、程度或数值下降。":"reduce the height, level or amount","映衬\n互相配合，使特点更加明显。":"set off each other's features through contrast or combination","绿意盎然\n绿色植物生机旺盛的样子。":"full of lush, lively greenery","灌木\n一般较矮小、靠近地面分枝较多的木本植物。":"a shrub; a usually low woody plant branching near the ground","品种\n同类事物中按特征分出的种类。":"a variety or type within a group","短暂\n持续的时间很短。":"lasting only a short time","逗留\n暂时停留。":"stay somewhere temporarily","松懈\n文中指让紧张的身心放松。":"here, let one's tense body and mind relax","领略\n了解并欣赏其中的意味或特色。":"experience and appreciate the special qualities of something","别具一格\n另有一种独特的风格或特点。":"having a distinctive style of its own","设施\n为某种用途而设置的设备或场所。":"equipment or places provided for a particular use","刺激\n引起强烈感受；文中指让人兴奋、紧张。":"exciting and thrilling; causing a strong feeling","不时\n时常，时不时。":"from time to time","腾云驾雾\n本指乘云雾飞行；文中形容在云雾中行走的感觉。":"literally, ride on clouds and mist; here, feel as if walking among them","奇幻\n奇异而富有幻想色彩。":"strange and imaginative, like a fantasy","神秘\n难以了解，带有未知感。":"mysterious; difficult to understand fully","步步惊心\n每走一步都令人紧张惊惧。":"every step feels frightening or thrilling","摇摇晃晃\n来回晃动，不平稳的样子。":"swaying or wobbling unsteadily","胆量\n面对令人害怕的情况时敢于行动的勇气。":"courage to act in a frightening situation","腾空而起\n离开地面，向空中跃起。":"leap or rise into the air","时尚\n一个时期流行的风格。":"a style popular at a particular time","特色\n与其他事物不同的突出特点。":"a distinctive feature","应有尽有\n应该有的都有，形容种类丰富齐全。":"having everything one could expect; offering a wide range","难得一见\n很少有机会看到。":"rarely seen","吸引力\n使人产生兴趣并愿意接近的力量。":"the power to attract interest","与时俱进\n跟随时代发展，不断进步和创新。":"keep developing and improving with the times","创新\n提出或创造新的想法、做法或事物。":"create new ideas, methods or things","国人\n文中指新加坡人。":"here, Singaporeans","航空\n利用飞机等在空中航行的活动。":"activities involving travel by aircraft","称赞\n用话语肯定别人的优点。":"praise","崇拜\n十分敬佩、仰慕。":"admire greatly","再三\n一次又一次。":"repeatedly","赞叹\n称赞并表示欣赏。":"praise with admiration","爱不释手\n非常喜欢，舍不得放下。":"love it too much to put it down","成就感\n做成事情或得到肯定后的满足感。":"a sense of achievement","截然相反\n两者完全不同，方向相反。":"completely opposite","碰钉子\n遭到拒绝，目标没有达到。":"meet with rejection","偶尔\n有时候，并不经常。":"occasionally","真诚\n真实诚恳，不虚假。":"sincere","欣赏\n觉得美好而喜欢、赞赏。":"appreciate and enjoy something's beauty or value","无比\n没有什么可以比得上，表示程度很深。":"extremely","愉快\n心情高兴、舒畅。":"happy and pleased","反观\n反过来看另一方，加以比较。":"in contrast","泼冷水\n用语言或行动打击别人的热情。":"dampen enthusiasm","甜言蜜语\n好听、动人的话。文中女儿的话使“我”温暖，不必理解为欺骗。":"sweet words; here, affectionate words","拍马屁\n用好听的话讨好别人。文中这是儿子对妹妹的看法。":"flatter to win favour","受用\n听了或得到了以后，觉得舒服、满足。":"feel comforted or pleased","抽屉\n桌子等家具中可抽出来存放东西的小格。":"drawer","各式各样\n有各种不同的样式。":"all kinds of","骄傲\n文中指因妈妈而感到自豪。":"proud","精疲力竭\n精神和力气都用尽了，非常疲累。":"utterly exhausted","值得\n付出的辛苦有意义、有价值。":"worthwhile","过世\n去世。":"pass away","衰老\n身体、精神逐渐老弱。":"grow old and weak","抑郁\n心情忧愁、低落。这里描述课文中的心情，不是医学诊断。":"low and sad in mood","沉默寡言\n不爱说话，说话很少。":"quiet and rarely speaking","寂寞\n因孤单而感到冷清。":"loneliness","打理\n料理、安排事务。":"take care of","负担\n需要承担的工作或责任。":"burden","热腾腾\n形容热气不断冒出的样子。":"steaming hot","感激\n因为受到帮助或关爱而心存感谢。":"grateful","启齿\n开口说话。":"open one’s mouth to speak","难以启齿\n觉得难为情，不容易开口说。":"feel too embarrassed to say it","不禁\n控制不住，自然而然地。":"cannot help doing","扪心自问\n认真反省自己的想法和行为。":"search one’s conscience","打气\n鼓励，使人增加信心。":"encourage","害羞\n因为难为情而不自在。":"shy or embarrassed","打退堂鼓\n做事中途退缩。":"back out halfway","懊恼\n因为做得不如意而后悔、烦恼。":"regretful and upset","再接再厉\n继续努力，不因挫折而停止。":"keep trying","伺机\n等待合适的机会。":"wait for an opportunity","疙瘩\n文中指心里的不自在、顾虑，不是皮肤上的小块。":"an emotional knot or unease","心不在焉\n心思不在正在做的事情上。":"absent-minded","佩服\n因别人的能力或表现而敬重。":"admire","把握\n抓住机会，不让它错过。":"seize","恐怕\n表示担心某种情况可能发生。":"be afraid that","破天荒\n以前从未有过。":"for the first time ever","仓促\n匆忙，来不及从容准备。":"hurried","夺门而出\n急忙冲出门去。":"rush out of the door","傍晚\n接近晚上的时候。":"early evening","熟悉\n知道得很清楚，不陌生。":"familiar","口头禅\n经常挂在口头的习惯语。":"a habitual expression","投入\n全心放在一件事上。":"give one's full attention to something","未接来电\n有电话打进来，但没有接听。":"a missed call; a phone call that was not answered","战战兢兢\n因害怕而小心谨慎、紧张不安的样子。":"trembling with fear and acting very cautiously","钥匙\n开锁或锁门的工具。":"a key used to lock or unlock something","紧皱眉头\n眉头紧紧皱起，显出担心或不满。":"frown deeply, showing worry or displeasure","严肃\n神情认真、不带笑容。":"serious and unsmiling","血丝\n眼睛里显出的细小血管。":"small blood vessels visible in the eyes","焦虑\n着急、担忧而不安。":"anxious; worried and unable to feel calm","不悦\n不高兴。":"displeased; unhappy","责问\n带着责备的语气询问。":"question someone in an accusing or blaming tone","安抚\n使情绪不安的人平静下来。":"calm and comfort someone who is upset","责备\n指出别人的过错并加以批评。":"blame or criticise someone for a mistake","干脆\n索性，直接采取某种做法。":"simply decide to take a direct course of action","委屈\n觉得自己受到误解或不公平对待而难过。":"feel hurt because one has been misunderstood, unfairly blamed or treated unfairly","更何况\n进一步提出更有力的理由。":"what is more; introduces an even stronger reason","静音模式\n手机不发出来电等提示声音的设置。":"silent mode; a phone setting that turns off alert sounds","冷战\n这里指家人争执后互不理睬。":"here, family members refuse to speak after a quarrel","和事佬\n调解争执，促使双方和好的人。":"a peacemaker who helps people settle a quarrel","歉意\n觉得对不起别人而产生的心情。":"a feeling of being sorry for having wronged someone","举白旗\n本指投降认输，这里指先认错道歉。":"literally, raise a white flag; here, take the first step to admit fault and apologise","温和\n说话或态度不急躁、不严厉。":"gentle and calm in speech or attitude","无聊\n没有感兴趣的事情可做，觉得没意思。":"bored; having nothing interesting to do","别扭\n这里指心里不自在，相处时不自然。":"here, feel awkward and uncomfortable with another person","回应\n对别人说的话作出回答或反应。":"reply or react to what someone says","五味杂陈\n多种感受交杂在一起，难以说清。":"have many mixed, hard-to-describe feelings","整理\n使东西有条理、便于使用。":"put things in order so they are easier to use","摇摇晃晃\n左右或上下摆动、不稳定的样子。":"swaying or wobbling unsteadily","尴尬\n这里指因关系不自然而感到不好意思。":"feel embarrassed because the relationship is awkward","挣脱\n用力摆脱束缚。":"struggle free from something holding one back","树丛\n聚集生长在一起的树木。":"a cluster of trees","提议\n提出想法，供大家考虑。":"suggest an idea for others to consider","慈爱\n长辈对晚辈温柔而关爱的态度。":"gentle, loving care from an elder","解压\n减轻心理压力。":"relieve mental stress","惊讶\n对出乎意料的事情感到吃惊。":"feel surprised by something unexpected","长斑\n皮肤上出现颜色较深的斑点。":"develop darker spots on the skin","主动\n不等别人要求，自己愿意去做。":"take the initiative without waiting to be asked","聚精会神\n把精神和注意力高度集中起来。":"concentrate all one's attention","缠绕\n条状物盘绕或绕住其他东西。":"wind around or become tangled around something","豆大\n像豆子一般大，用来突出汗珠明显。":"the size of a bean; here, describing large drops of sweat","搂\n用胳膊围住或抱住。":"put one's arm or arms around someone","如梦初醒\n好像刚从梦中醒来，比喻原来不明白，后来突然醒悟。":"suddenly realise the truth, as if waking from a dream","疲惫不堪\n十分疲乏，难以支撑。":"utterly exhausted; too tired to keep going","疲惫\n非常疲乏。":"very tired; exhausted","闷闷不乐\n因心事而不高兴。":"unhappy and troubled by worries","安慰\n用话语或行动使难过的人好受些。":"comfort someone through words or actions","打扰\n影响别人休息或做事。":"disturb someone who is resting or doing something","苦恼\n因困难而烦闷、不知道怎么办。":"feel troubled and unsure how to deal with a difficulty","贴心\n能体会别人的心情和需要。":"thoughtful; understanding another person's feelings and needs","欣慰\n感到安慰和高兴。":"feel comforted and pleased","犹豫\n拿不定主意。":"hesitate; be unable to decide","打气\n鼓励别人，给人信心。":"encourage someone and give them confidence","拥抱\n用双臂抱住别人。":"hug someone with both arms","不分青红皂白\n不弄清事情的缘由就作出判断。":"judge or blame without first finding out what happened","教训\n这里指责备。":"here, scold or reprimand someone","顶嘴\n用话反驳长辈的责备；课文中是妈妈对解释的看法。":"talk back to an elder; here, how Mother views the explanation","叛逆\n不愿顺从，反抗原有的要求；文中是妈妈对美华的评价。":"resist others' demands or authority; here, Mother's judgement of Meihua","委屈\n受到不应有的指责而心里难过。":"feel hurt because one has been misunderstood, unfairly blamed or treated unfairly","体谅\n设身处地理解别人的处境和心情。":"understand and consider another person's situation and feelings","刀子嘴豆腐心\n说话尖刻，但心地柔软。":"have a sharp tongue but a soft heart","内疚\n内心觉得有亏欠而惭愧。":"feel guilty for letting someone down or doing something wrong","不妨\n表示可以试一试。":"might as well; suggests trying something","匿名\n不写出姓名。":"without giving one's name; anonymous","允许\n答应、准许。":"allow; give permission","监督\n查看别人是否按要求去做。":"check that someone is doing what is required","窒息\n基本义是呼吸困难甚至停止；文中形容受到限制时的压抑感。":"suffocate; here, feel emotionally stifled by restrictions","代沟\n不同世代在想法、习惯等方面的差异，造成理解和沟通困难。":"a generation gap that makes understanding and communication difficult","无可厚非\n不能过分责备；这里指喜欢游戏、从中得到乐趣本身。":"not something to criticise too harshly; here, enjoying games in itself","上瘾\n对某事过度依赖，很难停止。":"become addicted; find it difficult to stop","无心\n没有心思去做某事。":"have no interest or attention left for something","疏远\n关系不如以前亲近。":"become less close to someone","限制\n规定不能超过的范围。":"set limits on what is allowed","设身处地\n把自己放在对方的处境来想。":"put oneself in another person's situation","迎刃而解\n比喻关键问题解决后，其他相关问题就容易解决。":"become easy to solve once the key difficulty is overcome","愧疚不已\n感到惭愧、自责，久久不能平静。":"remain deeply ashamed and remorseful","结局\n事情最后的结果。":"the final outcome of an event or story","愧疚\n觉得自己对不起别人或做错了事，心里不安。":"feel guilty and uneasy about having done wrong","光泽\n物体表面反射出来的亮光。":"the shine reflected from a surface","时值\n正当某个时候。":"at the time of; just when","寒冬\n很冷的冬天。":"a very cold winter","收养\n收留并供养。":"take in and care for a child or animal","多半\n很有可能，但还不是确定的事实。":"probably; likely but not certain","饥寒\n饥饿和寒冷。":"hunger and cold","帮佣\n在家中受雇帮忙做家务的人。":"a domestic helper employed to do housework","不活泼\n不爱活动，显得没有精神。":"inactive and lacking energy","忧郁\n忧愁、低落；课文写猫给人的印象。":"gloomy or sad; here, the impression the cat gives","理睬\n理会，对人或事作出回应。":"pay attention or respond to someone or something","枕\n文中指把头放在“我”的脚上，像枕着枕头。":"here, rest one's head on something as on a pillow","哈欠\n困倦时张大嘴、深吸气的动作。":"a yawn; opening the mouth and breathing deeply when tired","取暖\n使身体暖和。":"keep or make oneself warm","终日\n整天。":"all day long","懒洋洋\n懒散、不想活动的样子。":"sluggish and unwilling to move","无精打采\n没有精神，显得疲乏、提不起劲。":"listless; lacking energy or enthusiasm","叽叽啾啾\n模拟鸟叫的声音，文中写鸟叫得好听。":"chirping; an imitation of birds' pleasant calls","叮嘱\n再三提醒，希望对方记住。":"give repeated, caring reminders","照料\n照顾、料理。":"look after; care for","仰\n抬起头，向上看。":"raise one's head to look upwards","凝望\n专注、长时间地望着。":"gaze steadily and attentively","仿佛\n好像。":"as if; seemingly","留心\n注意、小心。":"pay attention; be watchful","羽毛松散\n羽毛散乱、不整齐。":"feathers that look loose and untidy","挣扎\n用力支撑或试图摆脱困境。":"struggle to stay alive or escape difficulty","愤怒\n十分生气。":"very angry; furious","判断\n根据情况作出看法或结论。":"form an opinion or conclusion from the situation","断定\n认为某个结论已经确定。":"decide that a conclusion is certain","罪状\n犯错或犯罪的事实，文中写家人对猫的指控。":"an alleged offence; here, the family's accusation against the cat","惩罚\n因对方被认为有错而给予处罚。":"punish someone believed to have done wrong","畏罪潜逃\n因害怕罪行受罚而偷偷逃走；文中是家人对猫的误判。":"flee secretly for fear of punishment; here, the family's mistaken interpretation of the cat's absence","露台\n房屋外面露天的平台。":"an open-air terrace outside a building","神态安详\n神情平静、从容的样子。":"a peaceful and calm expression","怒气冲天\n非常愤怒。":"extremely angry; furious","狠狠\n用力、毫不留情地。":"forcefully and without mercy","喵\n模拟猫的叫声。":"meow; the sound a cat makes","惨叫\n因痛苦或害怕而凄厉地叫。":"cry out painfully or in terror","狼狈\n处境窘迫、慌乱难堪的样子。":"distressed, dishevelled and helpless","衔\n用嘴叼着。":"hold or carry something in the mouth","谴责\n严厉责备；良心受到谴责指内心强烈自责。":"condemn strongly; here, suffer intense self-reproach","冤枉\n错怪无辜的人或动物。":"wrongly blame an innocent person or animal","辩解\n说明自己的理由，解释自己没有被指责的过错。":"explain oneself in defence against an accusation","始终\n从开始到最后一直。":"throughout; from beginning to end","猜想\n根据一些情况推测。":"guess or suppose from available clues","失踪\n失去踪迹，不知道在哪里。":"go missing; no longer be found","丝毫\n极小的程度，常用于否定句。":"even the slightest amount; often used with a negative","消减\n减少、减弱。":"decrease; become weaker","估计\n根据情况作大致的推测或判断。":"make an approximate judgement using available information","午夜梦回\n半夜从梦中醒来。":"wake from a dream in the middle of the night","隐约\n不很清楚。":"faint; not clearly seen or heard","悲楚\n悲伤、凄楚。":"deep sadness and sorrow","助养\n以经济等方式支持照顾动物。":"sponsor the care of an animal through financial or other support","捐款\n捐出金钱，帮助某个对象或计划。":"donate money to support someone or a cause","拯救\n提供救助，使对象脱离危险。":"rescue; help someone or something out of danger","医疗\n医治疾病或伤势。":"medical treatment for illness or injury","护理\n照顾健康、伤势和日常需要。":"care for health, injuries and daily needs","品质\n质量的好坏。":"quality; how good something is","经费\n进行活动或工作所需的钱。":"funds needed for an activity or project","实地\n亲自到有关地点。":"in person at the actual location","调查\n为了解情况而查问、观察或搜集资料。":"investigate by asking questions, observing or collecting information","保育\n保护和照顾生物及其生存环境。":"conserve and care for living things and their habitats","期限\n限定的一段时间。":"a fixed or limited period of time","优惠\n给予的好处或较有利的条件。":"a benefit, discount or favourable condition","证书\n证明某种资格或事实的文件。":"a certificate proving a fact or qualification","折扣券\n购物时可按规定减价的凭券。":"a discount voucher","四肢\n两条前肢和两条后肢。":"the four limbs; two forelimbs and two hindlimbs","敏捷\n动作迅速而灵敏。":"quick and agile in movement","穿梭\n在不同地方来回活动。":"move back and forth between places","自如\n活动自然、不受阻碍。":"move naturally and freely","亲切\n态度温和，使人感到亲近。":"warm and friendly","友善\n友好、和善。":"friendly and kind","担任\n承担某种职务或工作。":"take on a role or responsibility","亲善大使\n代表机构传递友好形象或信息的角色。":"a goodwill ambassador representing a friendly image or message","大摇大摆\n走路时身体摇摆，显得神气。":"strut or swagger confidently","探索\n寻找、观察并了解未知或新鲜的事物。":"explore and learn about something new or unknown","斑纹\n表面深浅或颜色不同的花纹。":"patterns of different shades or colours on a surface","独一无二\n独特，没有完全相同的。":"unique; no other exactly the same","辨识\n辨别并认出。":"recognise and identify","害羞\n感到不好意思或不自在。":"shy; feeling awkward or self-conscious","阴凉\n阳光照不到、较凉快。":"shaded from the sun and cool","馋\n看见好吃的食物就想吃。":"eager to eat tempting food","调皮\n爱玩闹，不大规矩。":"mischievous and playful","摔跤\n双方相抱，运用力气和技巧，使对方倒下的体育运动。":"wrestling; a sport in which opponents try to bring each other down","乐意\n愿意、高兴去做。":"be willing and happy to do something","配合\n一起做事，相互协调。":"cooperate and coordinate with others","凶猛\n猛烈、具有攻击性。":"fierce and aggressive","小看\n低估对方的能力或力量。":"underestimate someone's value, ability or strength","媒体\n向公众传播信息的机构或渠道。":"organisations or channels that communicate information to the public","糟糕\n情况很坏，令人不满意。":"very bad or unsatisfactory","塑料\n一种常用的人造材料，课文介绍它的用途及废弃后的问题。":"plastic; a common manufactured material","飞速\n非常迅速。":"at great speed; very rapidly","产量\n一定时间内生产出来的数量。":"the quantity produced during a period of time","几乎\n接近某种情况，但不表示完全如此。":"almost; nearly but not completely","扮演\n文中指发挥某种作用。":"here, play a particular role","一次性\n通常只使用一次。":"single-use; normally used only once","廉价\n价钱便宜。":"cheap; low in price","卫生\n清洁，符合健康方面的要求。":"clean and meeting health standards","耐用\n经得起使用，不容易损坏。":"durable; able to last through repeated use","风靡\n在一个时期或范围内非常流行。":"become extremely popular","垄断\n独占，文中指塑料袋几乎占据整个超市购物袋市场。":"dominate a market; here, plastic bags nearly take over supermarket bag use","消耗\n使用而逐渐耗去。":"use up gradually","调查\n通过询问、观察等方法了解情况。":"investigate by asking questions, observing or collecting information","至少\n表示数量的最低限度。":"at least; the minimum amount","相当于\n在数量、程度或大小上大致对应。":"be approximately equal to in amount, size or degree","丢弃\n扔掉，不再要。":"throw away; discard","污染\n使环境等受到有害物质影响。":"contaminate or damage the environment","降解\n材料逐渐分解的过程。":"break down into simpler substances over time","填埋\n把垃圾等埋进地下。":"bury waste in the ground","焚烧\n用火烧掉。":"burn; incinerate","环保\n保护环境。":"environmental protection","制品\n用某种材料制成的物品。":"an item made from a particular material","将近\n接近某个数量或程度。":"nearly; close to a given amount","再循环\n把废弃物回收处理后重新利用。":"recycle; process waste so it can be used again","纷纷\n接连地，一个接一个地。":"one after another; in large numbers","措施\n为解决问题而采取的办法。":"a measure or step taken to solve a problem","遏制\n制止，控制。":"curb; restrain or bring under control","征收\n依法收取税款或费用等。":"levy or collect a tax or fee","消费者\n购买或使用商品、服务的人。":"a consumer who buys or uses goods or services","多管齐下\n同时从多个方面采取办法。":"tackle a problem in several ways at the same time","倡导\n提倡并带头推动。":"promote and encourage a practice","逐渐\n慢慢地，一步步地。":"gradually; step by step","机构\n办理某类事务的组织。":"an organisation responsible for a type of work","奖励\n用一定方式鼓励某种行为或表现。":"reward or encourage a desired action","自备\n自己准备。":"bring or prepare one's own","问世\n新的事物出现。":"appear or become available for the first time","便利\n方便。":"convenience; making things easier","充斥\n充满，到处都是，常用于不好的事物。":"be filled with something, usually undesirable","威胁\n可能造成危险或损害。":"a threat; a possible source of harm","妥善\n稳妥而合适。":"properly and appropriately","煞费苦心\n费尽心思。":"take great pains and put much thought into something","不禁\n忍不住，不由自主。":"cannot help doing or feeling something","吨\n计量质量的单位，一吨等于一千千克。":"a tonne; 1,000 kilograms","烟尘\n燃烧产生的烟和细小颗粒。":"smoke and fine particles produced by burning","土壤\n地面上能供植物生长的泥土。":"soil in which plants can grow","吞食\n把食物或其他东西吞下去。":"swallow food or other objects","消化道\n食物在身体内通过并被消化的通道。":"the digestive tract through which food passes","堵塞\n被阻挡而不能畅通。":"block or clog a passage","丢弃\n扔掉，不再保留。":"throw away; discard","废弃\n因不再需要或不能使用而弃置。":"abandon because something is no longer needed or usable","电器\n利用电来工作的器具。":"an appliance powered by electricity","资讯\n信息。":"information","统计\n收集、整理数量资料并作出分析。":"collect, organise and analyse numerical data","构成\n由哪些部分组成。":"combine to form a whole; the parts making up a whole","电子垃圾\n课文指被废弃的电器或电子产品。":"electronic waste; discarded electrical or electronic products","日新月异\n每天每月都有新变化，形容变化发展很快。":"change and develop rapidly all the time","可供\n可以让人使用或选择。":"available for use or choice","更新\n用新的替换旧的。":"replace something old with something new","逐年\n一年一年地。":"year by year","预计\n预先估计，不表示事情已经发生。":"estimate or predict in advance; not something already observed","翻一番\n变成原来的两倍；本课所列4440与7400的比值约为1.67，应与原文概括区分。":"double; become twice the original amount. The passage's figures 4,440 and 7,400 have a ratio of about 1.67, so distinguish this phrase from those figures.","泛滥成灾\n原指水流溢出造成灾害；文中指电子垃圾过多，造成严重问题。":"become so excessive that serious problems result; here, an overflow of electronic waste","损坏\n使原有功能或形状受到破坏。":"damage something so it loses its original form or function","寿命\n文中指产品能够使用的时间。":"here, a product's useful lifespan","维修\n检查、修理并保养设备。":"inspect, repair and maintain equipment","途径\n达到目的的办法或渠道。":"a way or channel for achieving something","有限\n数量或范围不多。":"limited in amount or scope; not endless","喜新厌旧\n喜欢新的，厌弃旧的。":"prefer new things and lose interest in old ones","缺乏\n缺少。":"lack; not have enough","危害\n造成损害。":"cause harm or damage","追求\n努力寻找或争取。":"seek or strive for something","随意\n没有认真考虑，任由自己的意思行事。":"act as one wishes without careful thought","再循环利用\n把废弃物回收处理，使其中材料再次得到利用。":"recycle discarded materials for further use","智能\n具有一定自动处理信息能力的。":"able to process information automatically to some degree; smart","通常\n一般情况下，不表示毫无例外。":"usually; under normal circumstances, with possible exceptions","包含\n里面具有。":"include; contain","元素\n构成物质的基本类别；此处按课文说法理解金属材料。":"an element; here, the metals described in the passage","贵重\n价值高，值得珍惜。":"valuable; worth a great deal","回收\n把用过或废弃的物品收集回来处理或利用。":"collect used or discarded items for processing or reuse","价值\n文中指可回收材料的经济价值。":"here, the monetary worth of recoverable materials","估计\n根据已有情况大致判断。":"make an approximate judgement using available information","国内生产总值\n一个国家在一定时期内生产活动创造的总价值，简称GDP。":"gross domestic product (GDP); the value of production within a country during a period","遗憾\n因事情没有达到期望而感到可惜。":"regret; feel sorry that something falls short of expectations","填埋场\n用来填埋处理垃圾的场地。":"a landfill site for burying waste","不到\n低于所说的数量。":"less than the stated amount","谨慎\n认真小心，避免出错或造成损害。":"careful and cautious to avoid mistakes or harm","有毒\n含有能损害生物健康的毒性。":"toxic; containing substances that can harm living things","汞\n一种金属元素，常称水银；文中作为有毒重金属的例子。":"mercury; a metal given as an example of a toxic heavy metal","铅\n一种金属元素；文中作为有毒重金属的例子。":"lead; a metal given as an example of a toxic heavy metal","渗透\n液体等逐渐进入物体内部或穿过缝隙。":"seep or penetrate gradually into something","土壤\n地表可供植物生长的疏松物质。":"soil in which plants can grow","水源\n水的来源。":"a source of water","专业\n具有某一领域专门知识和技能的。":"having specialist knowledge and skills","陆续\n前后接连进行。":"one after another over time","设置\n设立、安排放置。":"set up or put in place","公众\n一般社会民众。":"the general public","投放\n投入或放置到指定地方。":"place or deposit something at a designated location","集中\n把分散的东西聚到一起。":"gather scattered things together","三思而行\n做事前慎重考虑，不是一定只想三次。":"think carefully before acting; not literally only three times","艰巨\n困难很多，任务繁重。":"very difficult and demanding","昂贵\n价格或成本很高。":"expensive; costing a great deal","消耗\n在使用过程中逐渐耗去。":"use up gradually","干旱\n长时间降雨不足而缺水。":"drought; a long period with too little rain","趋势\n整体发展的方向。":"the general direction of change; a trend","因素\n影响结果的原因或条件。":"a factor that influences a result","水喉\n本地日常用语，指水龙头。文中“四大水喉”比喻供水来源。":"a tap; the passage's Four National Taps refer figuratively to water sources","新生水\n经处理净化、供再使用的再生水。":"NEWater; treated and purified reclaimed water for reuse","淡化水\n把海水中的盐分去除后得到的水。":"desalinated water; seawater with the salt removed","能源\n能提供能量的资源。":"resources that provide energy","运输\n把人或物从一个地方送到另一个地方。":"transport people or goods from one place to another","扩大\n使范围或规模变大。":"increase the size or scale","集水区\n收集雨水并让雨水流入蓄水池的地区。":"a water catchment area that collects rainwater for reservoirs","蓄水池\n用来储存水的地方。":"a reservoir or place for storing water","有限\n有一定限制，并不是无穷无尽。":"limited in amount or scope; not endless","需求\n需要的数量或内容。":"demand; the amount or kind of something needed","比例\n一部分与整体或另一部分的数量关系。":"the relationship between a part and a whole, or between two quantities","平均\n把总量按人数等均分所得的数。":"an average; a total shared equally across people or units","浴室\n供人洗澡的房间。":"a room used for bathing","目标\n希望达到的结果。":"a goal; the result one hopes to reach","来之不易\n得到它并不容易，需要付出努力或资源。":"hard-won; requiring effort or resources to obtain","开源节流\n增加来源，同时减少不必要的消耗。文中指拓展水源并节约用水。":"increase sources and reduce waste; here, expand water supply while conserving water","可持续发展\n发展时也顾及未来的需要，避免耗尽资源。":"sustainable development that meets needs without exhausting resources for the future","憋\n勉强忍住，把话语或情绪压在心里。":"hold back words or feelings inside","勤奋\n努力而不懒惰。":"hard-working and diligent","不堪其扰\n不能忍受这种打扰。":"be unable to bear the repeated disturbance","刺眼\n光线强烈，使眼睛不舒服。":"dazzling; so bright that it hurts the eyes","清晨\n早晨天刚亮的一段时间。":"early morning, around daybreak","委婉\n说话温和含蓄，不直接生硬。":"express something gently and indirectly","彼此\n你我双方，相互。":"each other; both sides","作息\n工作、学习和休息的安排。":"one's schedule for work, study and rest","始终\n从开始到最后，一直。":"throughout; from beginning to end","发泄\n把不满等情绪表达或释放出来。":"vent or release frustration and other feelings","忍无可忍\n再也无法忍受。":"be unable to tolerate something any longer","吼\n大声喊叫。":"shout or roar loudly","怒气冲冲\n十分生气的样子。":"visibly furious","反驳\n说出理由，否定别人的意见。":"give reasons to challenge or reject another person's view","彻底\n完全，毫无保留。":"completely; thoroughly","冤家\n本课形容关系不和、互不搭理的两人。":"here, two people who are at odds and ignore each other","搭理\n理睬，与对方说话或回应。":"respond to or speak to someone","抬头不见低头见\n形容经常见面。":"see each other frequently in daily life","共处一室\n一起待在同一个房间里。":"share or stay in the same room","仿佛\n好像，似乎。":"as if; seemingly","凝固\n由流动状态变成固定状态；这里写气氛僵硬。":"solidify; here, the atmosphere becomes stiff and tense","扭动\n转动。":"twist or turn","缓缓\n慢慢地。":"slowly and gradually","裂开一条缝\n这里指门慢慢打开，露出一道窄缝。":"here, the door opens slightly, leaving a narrow gap","披散\n散开垂着，没有束起。":"hang loose and untied, as hair","吭声\n出声，说话。":"make a sound; speak up","微微\n稍微，轻轻地。":"slightly; gently","仰起\n把头或脸抬起来。":"raise one's head or face","扫\n这里指目光迅速看过。":"here, glance quickly over something","古怪\n奇怪，不寻常。":"strange; unusual","随即\n紧接着就。":"immediately afterwards","掩\n这里指关上门。":"here, close the door","对视\n互相看着对方。":"look at each other","恐惧\n害怕。":"fear; feeling afraid","鼓起勇气\n努力使自己有勇气去做事。":"summon the courage to do something","探出身\n把身体向外伸出一些。":"lean part of one's body out","空荡荡\n空空的，没有人或东西。":"empty; without people or things","熄灯\n把灯关掉，使灯不亮。":"switch off the lights","颤抖\n不由自主地抖动；这里指声音因害怕而不稳。":"tremble; here, the voice shakes with fear","诡异\n奇异、奇特，让人感到不寻常。":"eerie; strange in an unsettling way","隐约\n看得或听得不很清楚。":"faint; not clearly seen or heard","蜷缩\n身体弯曲缩成一团。":"curl one's body up into a small shape","瑟瑟发抖\n身体不停地轻轻抖动；本课表现害怕。":"shiver or tremble continuously; here, from fear","恐怖\n令人感到害怕、胆战心惊。":"frightening; causing terror","居然\n表示出乎意料。":"unexpectedly; to one's surprise","打断\n使别人的话或正在做的事中途停下。":"interrupt someone speaking or doing something","竟然\n表示出乎意料。":"unexpectedly; to one's surprise","通宵\n整夜。":"throughout the night","共同点\n彼此相同的地方。":"something shared or held in common","道歉\n表示自己有错，请求原谅。":"admit a mistake and ask for forgiveness","讨厌鬼\n本课是“我”对蒋妍的负面称呼。":"an annoying person; here, the narrator's unkind label for Jiang Yan","惊悚\n令人惊惧、害怕。":"frightening and suspenseful","误会\n对人或事情产生了错误的理解。":"misunderstand a person or situation","交流\n彼此交换意见、想法或感受。":"communicate and exchange ideas, experiences or feelings","和谐\n相处融洽、协调。":"get along peacefully and comfortably","身材\n身体的高矮、胖瘦等整体样子。":"one's body build, such as height and size","自卑\n轻视自己，认为自己不如别人。":"feel inferior; believe oneself less worthy than others","健美\n健康而体态优美。":"healthy and physically well-built","羡慕\n看到别人有好处或长处，希望自己也有。":"wish to have another person's advantages or qualities","抗拒\n抵抗、拒绝接受；文中指抵挡零食的吸引。":"resist or refuse to accept; here, resist the pull of snacks","诱惑\n吸引人去做某件事的力量。":"temptation; something that strongly attracts one to act","毅力\n坚强持久的意志。":"perseverance; firm and lasting determination","坚持\n持续做下去，不轻易停止。":"keep going without giving up easily","戒掉\n改掉某种习惯，不再继续。":"give up a habit","疏远\n关系不再像以前亲近。":"become less close to someone","茫然\n不明白发生什么、不知所措的样子。":"confused and unsure what to do","魂不守舍\n心神不定，注意力不集中。":"distracted and unable to concentrate","打瞌睡\n因困倦而一阵一阵地进入浅睡状态。":"doze off briefly because of tiredness","睡眠不足\n睡的时间不够；文中是主人对美星状态的推测。":"not getting enough sleep; here, a suggested explanation for Meixing's condition","闪烁其词\n说话躲躲闪闪，不肯把事情说清楚。":"speak evasively without explaining things clearly","嫌\n厌恶；不满意。":"dislike or be dissatisfied with","逼\n强迫别人按自己的要求做。":"force someone to do what one wants","霸道\n强横，不讲道理；文中是主人对哥哥行为的评价。":"domineering and unreasonable; here, the writer's judgement of her brother","示好\n用言语或行动表示友善，希望改善关系。":"show friendliness to improve a relationship","怄气\n生闷气，闹别扭。":"sulk; remain quietly upset with someone","烹饪\n做饭做菜。":"cook and prepare food","浓厚\n程度深；兴趣浓厚就是很感兴趣。":"strong or deep; here, very interested","选修\n从可选的课程中选择学习。":"choose to study an optional subject","营养与食品科学\n文中主人想选修的科目，涉及食物、营养及相关科学知识。":"Nutrition and Food Science; the subject the writer wishes to study","厨师\n以做饭做菜为职业的人。":"a cook or chef by profession","会计师\n从事会计专业工作的人。":"an accountant","符合\n与要求、情况或想法相合。":"match or meet a requirement, situation or idea","期望\n希望达到某种结果。":"an expectation or hope for a particular result","尽管\n表示先承认一种情况，后面再说明另一种结果或做法。":"although; acknowledges one situation before stating a different outcome or response","敏感\n容易受到外界影响，产生较强的感受。":"sensitive; easily and strongly affected by others or one's surroundings","不经意\n没有特别留意；无意之间。":"without special attention; unintentionally","瞥\n很快地看一眼。":"glance briefly","利箭\n尖锐的箭；文中比喻让“我”受伤的目光。":"a sharp arrow; here, a comparison for hurtful looks","炙烤\n用强热烤；文中写被注视时强烈的难受感。":"scorch with intense heat; here, the painful feeling of being stared at","沉默\n不说话。":"remain silent","独来独往\n独自行动，不常与别人交往。":"keep to oneself; usually act alone","武装\n原指装备武器；文中指用沉默、独处保护自己。":"arm oneself; here, protect oneself through silence and isolation","假想敌\n想象中与自己对立或会伤害自己的对象。":"an imagined enemy or threat","掩饰\n设法遮盖，不让人看出来。":"hide or cover something so others cannot see it","缺陷\n不完善的地方。":"an imperfection or shortcoming","提议\n提出意见，供大家考虑。":"suggest an idea for others to consider","布告栏\n张贴通知或展示资料的地方。":"a noticeboard used to display announcements or information","兴致勃勃\n兴趣很浓，情绪很高。":"full of interest and enthusiasm","叽叽喳喳\n形容许多人杂乱地说话的声音。":"the lively, overlapping sound of many people talking","谷底\n山谷最底处；文中形容心情极度低落。":"the bottom of a valley; here, an extremely low emotional state","拘束\n不自然、不自在。":"restrained and ill at ease","慌乱\n因害怕或着急而心里乱。":"flustered and confused through fear or anxiety","嘈杂\n声音杂乱，显得吵闹。":"noisy, with many sounds mixed together","局促不安\n紧张、拘束，感到不自在。":"nervous, awkward and uncomfortable","沮丧\n失望、灰心，情绪低落。":"disappointed and discouraged","七嘴八舌\n许多人纷纷说话、发表意见。":"many people talking or giving opinions at once","遥望\n向远处看。":"look into the distance","若有所思\n好像在思考什么。":"look as though thinking about something","定格\n把某一瞬间的画面固定下来。":"freeze a moment in an image","附和\n赞同别人的话，跟着表示同样的意见。":"echo or agree with someone else's opinion","睿智\n有智慧，有见识。":"wise and insightful","感动不已\n非常感动，情绪久久不能平静。":"be deeply moved for a long time","模糊\n不清楚。":"unclear; blurred","肯定\n认可、赞许。":"recognise and approve of","突破\n越过原来的限制或障碍。":"break through a limit or obstacle","心防\n心里的防备。":"emotional defences; guarding oneself against being hurt","结交\n与人交往并建立关系。":"get to know someone and form a relationship","或多或少\n在程度上多少有一些。":"to some extent; more or less","无处不在\n到处都有，文中强调雨树常见于生活中。":"found everywhere; here, rain trees are common in daily life","遮阳挡雨\n遮住阳光，挡住雨水。":"provide shade from the sun and shelter from rain","逐一\n一个接着一个。":"one by one","姿态万千\n姿态丰富多样。":"having many varied forms and graceful shapes","疲惫\n十分疲乏；文中赋予叶子人的情态。":"exhausted; here, a human feeling attributed to leaves","从容\n镇定、不慌忙的样子。":"calm and unhurried","翠绿\n鲜明的绿色。":"a vivid, fresh green","浪漫\n富有诗意与想象，带来美好的感受。":"poetic and imaginative, creating a lovely feeling","花季\n开花的时期。":"the flowering season","居高临下\n从高处往低处看。":"look down from a high position","花海\n把大片盛开的花比作海，突出花多而广。":"a sea of flowers; a vast area full of blossoms","轻轻柔柔\n动作轻缓、柔和。":"gently and softly","心旷神怡\n心情舒畅，精神愉快。":"feel refreshed, relaxed and happy","空旷\n地方开阔，遮挡物少。":"open and spacious, with few obstructions","曝晒\n在强烈的阳光下长时间晒。":"be exposed to strong sunlight for a long time","烈日\n强烈的太阳。":"the blazing sun","宽阔\n宽而开阔。":"wide and open","炎阳\n火热的太阳。":"the scorching sun","合拢\n聚合到一起。":"close or draw together","林荫大道\n两旁树木成行、枝叶遮出阴凉的大道。":"a broad avenue shaded by rows of trees","默默\n不出声地。":"silently; without saying anything","耸立\n高高地直立着。":"stand tall and upright","祝福\n表达希望别人平安幸福的美好愿望。":"express good wishes for someone's happiness and well-being","渐行渐远\n越走越远。":"move farther and farther away","依依\n留恋、不舍的样子。":"reluctant to part; feeling attached","叮咛\n反复嘱咐。":"give repeated, caring reminders","保重\n照顾好自己的身体。":"take care of one's health and well-being","温馨\n温暖而亲切，让人感到舒适。":"warm, affectionate and comforting","千姿百态\n姿态各不相同，十分丰富。":"having a rich variety of shapes and forms","出神\n注意力集中在一件事上，好像忘了周围。":"be so absorbed in thought that one seems unaware of the surroundings","粗糙\n文中指枝干表面不平滑。":"rough; here, describing the uneven surface of branches","婆娑\n轻柔舞动的姿态。":"sway gracefully and gently","随意\n不拘固定样式。":"freely, without a fixed pattern","楚楚可人\n形容姿态柔美，让人喜爱。":"graceful and charming","壮汉\n身材强壮的男子。":"a strong, well-built man","顽童\n顽皮的孩子。":"a mischievous child","翱翔\n在空中盘旋飞翔。":"soar and circle in the sky","褐色\n像棕色的颜色。":"brown","随性\n依自己的性情，不拘束；文中指树根自然伸展。":"free and natural; here, roots grow without a fixed pattern","伸展\n向外伸开。":"stretch or spread outwards","同甘共苦\n共同享受幸福，也共同承担困难。":"share both happiness and hardship","茁壮\n生长得健壮。":"grow strong and healthy","包容\n宽容、接纳不同的人或事物。":"be tolerant and accepting of differences","接纳\n接受，让对方加入或成为一分子。":"accept and welcome someone or something","齐心\n大家想法一致，共同努力。":"work together with a shared purpose","奉献\n为他人或共同的目标付出。":"give one's effort for others or a common goal","无怨无悔\n不埋怨，也不后悔。":"without complaint or regret","舒适\n让人感到舒服。":"comfortable","犹如\n好像，如同。":"like; as if","绿化\n栽种或保留植物，让环境有更多绿色。":"plant or preserve vegetation to make an area greener","柔美\n柔和而美好。":"gentle and beautiful","惊慌\n因突然发生的事而害怕、慌乱。":"frightened and flustered by something sudden","交代\n说明或嘱咐有关事情。":"explain something or give instructions","匆匆\n急急忙忙的样子。":"hurriedly; in a rush","患\n得了某种疾病。":"suffer from an illness","失智症\n课文中母亲患的疾病，使她的记忆和对当下情境的理解出现困难。":"dementia; in the passage, Mother's illness makes remembering and understanding her present situation difficult","独居\n独自居住。":"live alone","周全\n考虑全面，安排妥当。":"thorough and well-arranged","凝重\n严肃、沉重；这里表现担忧。":"serious and heavy; here, showing worry","小姑\n妻子对丈夫妹妹的称呼；本课指“我”的妹妹。":"a wife's husband's younger sister; here, the narrator's younger sister","踪影\n踪迹和身影。":"a trace or sign of someone's whereabouts","寻人启事\n为了寻找某个人而发布的消息。":"a missing-person notice","流逝\n像流水一样过去，常用于时间。":"pass by, like flowing water; often used for time","沉重\n这里指心情忧虑，难以轻松。":"here, weighed down with worry","不解\n不明白。":"puzzled; unable to understand","巴刹\n新加坡、马来西亚常用语，指市场。":"a market; a local term used in Singapore and Malaysia","叮嘱\n因关切或不放心而嘱咐对方注意。":"give repeated, caring reminders","会合\n在约定的地方聚到一起。":"meet at an agreed place","浮现\n在眼前或脑海中出现。":"appear before one's eyes or in one's mind","嬉戏\n快乐地玩耍。":"play happily","话家常\n聊日常生活中的事情。":"chat about everyday family life","慈祥\n和善安详，常用来形容长辈。":"kind and gentle, usually describing an elder","咖喱卜\n一种包有咖喱馅料的酥皮点心。":"a curry puff; a pastry with a curry filling","不约而同\n事先没有商量，却作出相同的举动。":"do the same thing without arranging it beforehand","气派十足\n很有气势、很像样。":"grand and impressive","桅杆\n船上用来悬挂帆等的高杆。":"a mast; a tall pole on a boat used to hold sails","俏皮\n活泼可爱，带点调皮的感觉。":"playful, lively and a little cheeky","惬意\n感到满足、舒服自在。":"contented and comfortably at ease","温馨\n温暖、亲切，使人感到舒心。":"warm, affectionate and comforting","承载\n这里指保存、包含着快乐的回忆。":"here, hold or preserve happy memories","寄托\n把情感或希望放在某个人或事物上。":"place one's feelings or hopes in someone or something","泪痕\n眼泪留下的痕迹。":"marks left by tears","触动\n受到影响，内心产生感受。":"be emotionally affected or moved","焦虑\n因担忧而不安。":"anxious; worried and unable to feel calm","烦躁\n心烦、不安，难以平静。":"irritable and restless","消散无踪\n完全消失，没有留下踪迹。":"disappear completely without a trace","柔声\n用温柔、轻缓的声音。":"in a gentle, soft voice","简陋\n简单粗糙，设备或条件不完善。":"simple and poorly equipped","开辟\n把原来未充分利用的土地开发出来。":"develop previously unused or underused land","兴建\n开始建造。":"begin construction; build","实施\n把计划实际做出来。":"put a plan into practice","居者有其屋\n课文中的住房计划名称，让国人以优惠价格买到自己的房子。":"the housing scheme described in the passage, helping citizens buy their own homes at favourable prices","优惠\n在价格等方面给予较有利的条件。":"a benefit, discount or favourable condition","所需\n所需要的东西或条件。":"what is needed","凝聚力\n使居民彼此联系、愿意团结合作的力量。":"the bond that unites people and encourages cooperation","规划\n对设施、空间等作整体安排。":"plan the overall arrangement of spaces or facilities","邻里中心\n为附近居民提供商店和生活服务的地方。":"a neighbourhood centre with shops and everyday services","宗教\n有关信仰的思想和活动。":"religious beliefs and practices","综合\n把几个方面结合在一起。":"combine several different aspects","综合诊疗所\n提供多种基层医疗服务的诊所。":"a polyclinic offering a range of primary healthcare services","经济\n与生产、贸易、消费等有关的活动和状况。":"activities and conditions involving production, trade and consumption","蓬勃\n兴盛、有活力的样子。":"thriving; full of growth and energy","富裕\n财物充足，生活宽裕。":"well-off; having sufficient wealth","与时俱进\n随着时代的发展不断进步。":"keep developing and improving with the times","注入\n这里指加入，使设计更有活力。":"here, introduce something that adds energy to a design","新颖\n新鲜而有特色，不落俗套。":"fresh and original","美观\n看起来漂亮。":"pleasing in appearance","变迁\n随着时间推移而发生变化。":"changes that take place over time","环保\n环境保护。":"environmental protection","人口老化\n人口中老年人的比例增加。":"population ageing; a growing proportion of older people","交流\n彼此沟通、分享想法或一起活动。":"communicate and exchange ideas, experiences or feelings","障碍\n使行动或事情难以顺利进行的阻碍。":"an obstacle that makes movement or progress difficult","无障碍\n通过环境与设施设计，减少行动不便者遇到的阻碍。":"barrier-free; designed to improve access for people with mobility difficulties","完善\n这里指设施越来越齐备，使用起来更合适。":"here, make facilities more complete and suitable for use","宜居\n适合人们居住。":"suitable and pleasant to live in","驰名\n名声传播得很远。":"widely renowned","海内外\n国内和国外。":"at home and abroad","屡次\n多次，一次又一次。":"repeatedly; many times","荣誉\n因受到肯定而获得的光荣或好名声。":"honour or recognition for an achievement","标志\n能使人认出或联想到某事物的代表。":"a symbol or feature that represents something","赞誉有加\n给予很高的赞扬。":"praise very highly","多元\n包含多种不同的成分或特色。":"diverse; containing different elements or features","开放\n愿意接触、接纳外来的人和文化。":"open to people and cultures from elsewhere","自古以来\n从古代一直到现在。":"since ancient times","特色\n与别处不同的特点。":"a distinctive feature","可谓\n可以说是。":"can be described as","得天独厚\n具有特别优越的条件。":"enjoy particularly favourable natural conditions","岛屿\n四面被水包围的陆地。":"an island; land surrounded by water","海峡\n两块陆地之间连接两个海域的狭窄水道。":"a strait; a narrow waterway connecting two larger bodies of water","中转站\n途中转运货物或换乘的地方。":"a transit point where goods or travellers change routes","挖掘\n向下挖，把埋藏的东西找出来。":"dig up something buried","贡献\n为发展或进步作出的有益作用。":"a helpful contribution to development or progress","心胸\n待人处事时的气量。":"one's openness and generosity towards others","族群\n具有共同文化等特点的人群。":"a group sharing cultural or other common characteristics","记载\n把事情写下来保存。":"record events in writing","区域\n一定范围的地区。":"a region or area","汇集\n从不同地方集中到一起。":"come together from different places","逐渐\n慢慢地发生变化。":"gradually; step by step","聚集\n集中到一起。":"gather together","沿海\n靠近海岸的地区。":"along or near the coast","陆续\n前后相接，一个接一个。":"one after another over time","通婚\n不同群体之间结婚。":"marry across different communities","后代\n后来出生的子孙。":"descendants; later generations","峇峇\n课文指早期华人与当地人通婚的男性后代。":"Baba; in the passage, male descendants of early Chinese-local marriages","娘惹\n课文指早期华人与当地人通婚的女性后代。":"Nyonya; in the passage, female descendants of early Chinese-local marriages","登陆\n从船等交通工具到陆地上。":"go ashore; arrive on land from a boat or other transport","赋予\n给予某种意义、特色或使命等。":"give a meaning, quality or role to something","海纳百川\n像大海容纳河流一样，形容胸怀宽广。":"be broad-minded and accepting, like the sea receiving many rivers","依然\n仍然，还是和以前一样。":"still; remaining as before","五湖四海\n各个地方。":"all parts of the world","贸易\n买卖货物的活动。":"trade; buying and selling goods","促进\n推动事情发展。":"promote or help something develop","流通\n从一个地方转到另一个地方。":"move or circulate from place to place","文化艺术\n体现人们生活、思想和审美的文化形式。":"cultural and artistic forms expressing people's lives, ideas and sense of beauty","南来北往\n往来于南方和北方。":"travel back and forth between different regions","东奔西走\n到处奔忙。":"rush about from place to place","客商\n外来经营买卖的商人。":"a merchant who has come from elsewhere","香料\n有香气、可用于调味等用途的材料。":"spices or other fragrant substances used for flavouring and similar purposes","瓷器\n以瓷土等烧制的器物。":"porcelain; objects made from fired clay","丝绸\n用蚕丝织成的纺织品。":"silk; cloth woven from silk fibres","食材\n用来制作食物的材料。":"ingredients used to prepare food","体验\n亲身感受。":"experience something personally","清香\n清淡而好闻的香气。":"a light, pleasant fragrance","浓郁\n香气或味道浓厚。":"rich and strong in flavour or fragrance","香喷喷\n形容香气浓而令人喜爱。":"having a strong, appetising aroma","椰浆饭\n用椰浆煮成米饭、配上其他食物的餐食。":"nasi lemak; coconut rice served with accompaniments","黄姜饭\n以香料等烹煮而成的米饭菜肴。":"a rice dish cooked with spices","初来乍到\n初次来到一个新地方。":"have just arrived in an unfamiliar place","啧啧称奇\n连声赞叹，觉得奇妙。":"repeatedly express admiration and wonder","与此同时\n在这同一个时候。":"at the same time","生根发芽\n这里比喻文化在当地建立并发展起来。":"take root and grow; here, a culture becomes established locally","南音\n课文介绍的华族传统音乐形式。":"nanyin; the traditional Chinese musical form introduced in the passage","新谣\n课文介绍的富有时代特色的本地歌曲。":"xinyao; the local song tradition introduced in the passage","婉转悠扬\n声音曲折悦耳，传得悠长。":"melodious, flowing and lingering pleasantly","班顿诗\n课文介绍的马来文化诗歌形式。":"pantun; the Malay poetic form introduced in the passage","婆罗多舞\n课文介绍的印度文化舞蹈形式。":"Bharatanatyam; the Indian dance form introduced in the passage","传承\n把已有的文化接续下来。":"pass on and continue culture, traditions or experience","创新\n在发展中形成新的内容或形式。":"create new ideas, methods or things","引人瞩目\n引起人们注意。":"attract attention","丰富多彩\n内容丰富，形式多样。":"rich in content and varied in form","变迁\n事物随时间发生变化。":"changes that take place over time","始终未变\n从开始到后来一直没有改变。":"remain unchanged throughout","兼容并蓄\n同时容纳和吸收不同的事物或文化。":"embrace and draw on different ideas or cultures","求同存异\n寻找共同点，同时保留不同点。":"seek common ground while respecting differences","携手\n这里指共同合作。":"join hands; here, cooperate","辉煌\n光辉灿烂；这里指未来成就出色。":"brilliant and successful; here, describing future achievements","衣食住行\n穿衣、吃饭、居住、出行等日常生活。":"everyday needs: clothing, food, housing and transport","生老病死\n出生、衰老、生病、死亡等人生经历。":"the stages of life: birth, ageing, illness and death","取长补短\n吸取别人的长处，弥补自己的不足。":"learn from others' strengths to make up for one's weaknesses","海量\n数量非常多。":"an enormous quantity","不乏\n并不缺少，有不少。":"have plenty of; not be lacking in","普遍\n在许多地方、情况中都存在。":"widespread; found in many places or situations","流言\n没有可靠根据而流传的话。":"a rumour without a reliable basis","传闻\n辗转听来的消息。":"hearsay; information passed from person to person","预示\n事先显示某种情况可能出现。":"indicate in advance that something may happen","典型\n具有代表性的。":"typical; representative","动荡\n局势不稳定。":"unstable or turbulent","普及\n推广到较广的范围，许多人都使用或知道。":"spread widely so many people use or know something","无远弗届\n不管多远都能到达，文中形容影响范围很广。":"reach everywhere, however far away; here, have a very wide influence","荒诞不经\n说法离奇、不可信。":"absurd and unbelievable","降临\n来到。":"arrive; come upon","辨别\n根据特点分清差别。":"distinguish by examining features","改头换面\n改变外表或形式，文中指修改图像原来的样子。":"change the appearance or form; here, alter an image","真相\n事情的真实情况。":"the truth about what happened","误导\n使人产生错误的认识或判断。":"mislead someone into a wrong understanding or judgement","三人成虎\n多人反复传播同一说法，容易使人信以为真。":"repeated claims by many people can make an unfounded story seem true","信以为真\n把不真实或未证实的事情当成真的。":"believe something false or unverified to be true","真伪\n真假。":"whether something is genuine or false","半信半疑\n有些相信，又有些怀疑。":"half believing and half doubting","陷阱\n文中比喻诱使人受骗的圈套。":"a trap; here, a scheme that tricks people","互信\n彼此信任。":"mutual trust","创新\n创造新的内容、方法或事物。":"create new ideas, methods or things","无从说起\n没有条件或基础谈起这件事。":"have no basis or conditions from which to begin","步伐\n本指走路的脚步，文中比喻时代发展的进程。":"literally, footsteps; here, the pace of development","警觉\n对可能出现的问题保持注意。":"remain alert to possible problems","查证\n调查核实，取得可供判断的依据。":"investigate and verify using evidence","询问\n向别人打听情况。":"ask someone for information","人云亦云\n缺少自己的判断，别人怎么说就跟着怎么说。":"repeat what others say without one's own judgement","独立思考\n自己根据理由与证据作出判断。":"think independently using reasons and evidence","免疫力\n文中比喻辨别并抵抗假信息影响的能力。":"immunity; here, the ability to recognise and resist false information","凝聚力\n使人们团结在一起的力量。":"the bond that unites people and encourages cooperation","中转站\n途中转运货物的地方。":"a transit point where goods or travellers change routes","经由\n经过某个地方或通过某种途径。":"via; through a particular place or route","传播\n传到其他地方，让更多人接触或知道。":"spread to other places or people","交流\n彼此沟通、交换事物或经验。":"communicate and exchange ideas, experiences or feelings","起源\n最初产生或开始的地方、时间。":"the place or time where something first began","质地\n物品的材料性质或触感。":"the nature or texture of a material","光泽\n物体表面反射出来的光亮。":"the shine reflected from a surface","奢侈\n花费太多钱财，过分享受。":"spend excessively on enjoyment or comfort","奢侈品\n价格较高、供人享受的非基本生活必需品。":"luxury goods; costly items beyond basic necessities","瓷器\n用瓷土烧制的器物，如碗、盘和花瓶。":"porcelain; objects made from fired clay","流通\n在不同地方之间流动、转运或交换。":"move or circulate from place to place","促进\n推动事物向前发展。":"promote or help something develop","香料\n具有香气，可用于调味等用途的物质。":"spices or other fragrant substances used for flavouring and similar purposes","盛产\n大量出产。":"produce in large quantities","烹饪\n做饭、做菜。":"cook and prepare food","宗教仪式\n与宗教信仰有关的特定活动或程序。":"a religious ceremony or ritual","秉持\n坚持并保持某种态度或原则。":"uphold an attitude or principle","融入\n进入一个群体，并成为其中的一部分。":"become part of a group or community","密切\n关系紧密。":"close and strongly connected","枢纽\n事物相互联系的中心环节。":"a hub; a central point connecting different parts","全球化\n世界各地的联系和相互影响不断加强的过程。":"globalisation; increasing connections and mutual influence across the world","趋势\n事物发展的方向。":"the general direction of change; a trend","港口\n船只停靠、装卸货物或上下旅客的地方。":"a port where ships dock and load goods or passengers","一流\n水平很高。":"first-rate; of a very high standard","致力\n把力量集中用于某项事情。":"devote one's efforts to something","多元\n具有多种不同的组成或形式。":"diverse; containing different elements or features","身份认同\n知道并认同自己属于某个群体。":"a sense of identity and belonging to a group","传承\n把文化、经验等一代一代传下去。":"pass on and continue culture, traditions or experience","并存\n同时存在。":"coexist; exist at the same time","特质\n特别的性质或特点。":"a distinctive quality or characteristic","接纳\n接受并容纳。":"accept and welcome someone or something","勾勒\n用简单的笔墨描写事物的大致情况。":"outline or sketch the main features","愿景\n希望在未来实现的图景。":"a vision of what one hopes to achieve in the future","数码化\n利用数码科技改变处理信息、工作或服务的方式。":"digitalisation; using digital technology to change how work, information or services are handled","高瞻远瞩\n形容眼光远大，能考虑长远的发展。":"be far-sighted and consider long-term development","受惠\n得到好处。":"benefit; receive an advantage"};
 const KEY='huawentong-personal-words-v1',SCHEMA='huawentong-words-v1';
 const context=()=>window.HWT_WORD_CONTEXT?.()||(typeof DATA!=='undefined'?DATA:{});const catalogue=window.LESSON_CATALOG||[];const resolve=id=>catalogue.find(l=>l.id===id||(l.aliases||[]).includes(id));let lesson={};function refreshContext(){const d=context(),c=resolve(d.lessonId);lesson={id:c?.id||d.lessonId||'',title:c?.title||d.lessonTitle||'',grade:c?.grade||d.grade||null,unit:c?.unit||d.unit||null};return d}refreshContext();const dictionary=()=>window.HWT_WORD_LEXICON?.()||(typeof LESSON_WORDS!=='undefined'?LESSON_WORDS:{});
 const $=s=>document.querySelector(s),esc=s=>String(s??'').replace(/[&<>"']/g,c=>({'&':'&amp;','<':'&lt;','>':'&gt;','"':'&quot;',"'":'&#39;'}[c]));
 let book={schema:SCHEMA,entries:[]},mode='list',scope='all',grade=String(lesson.grade||''),unit='',lessonFilter='',includeKnown=false,deck=[],index=0,flipped=false,notice='',lastFocus=null;
 try{const v=JSON.parse(localStorage.getItem(KEY));if(v?.schema===SCHEMA&&Array.isArray(v.entries))book=v}catch{}
 function enrichEnglish(){if(!englishVisible())return;let changed=false;for(const e of book.entries){if(!e.en&&e.source!=='我的补充'){const en=textbookEnglish[e.word+'\n'+e.meaning];if(en){e.en=en;changed=true}}for(const v of e.senses||[]){if(!v.en){const en=textbookEnglish[e.word+'\n'+v.meaning];if(en){v.en=en;changed=true}}}}if(changed)persist()}
 function reload(){try{const v=JSON.parse(localStorage.getItem(KEY));if(v?.schema===SCHEMA&&Array.isArray(v.entries))book=v}catch{}enrichEnglish()}
 function sourceFor(id,e){const c=resolve(id);if(c)return {lessonId:c.id,title:c.title,grade:c.grade,unit:c.unit};const old=(e.sources||[]).find(s=>s.lessonId===id);return old||{lessonId:id,title:e.examples?.find(x=>x.lessonId===id)?.lessonTitle||'未分类课文',grade:null,unit:null}}
 function sources(e){const all=[...(e.sources||[]),...(e.lessons||[]).map(id=>sourceFor(id,e))],unique=new Map();all.forEach(v=>{const c=resolve(v.lessonId);const a=c?{lessonId:c.id,title:c.title,grade:c.grade,unit:c.unit}:v;unique.set(a.lessonId,a)});return [...unique.values()]}
 function filterSource(s){return (!grade||(grade==='?'?!s.grade:String(s.grade)===grade))&&(!unit||String(s.unit)===unit)&&(!lessonFilter||s.lessonId===lessonFilter)}
 function sourceLabel(s){return (s.grade?'中'+['','一','二','三','四','五','六'][s.grade]+' · ':'未分类 · ')+(s.unit?'单元'+s.unit+' · ':'')+'《'+s.title+'》'}
 function normal(raw){return String(raw||'').normalize('NFKC').trim().replace(/^[“”‘’"']+|[“”‘’"']+$/g,'')}
 function valid(w){return /^[\p{Script=Han}·]{1,20}$/u.test(w)}
 function persist(){try{localStorage.setItem(KEY,JSON.stringify(book));return true}catch{return false}}
 function examples(word){const ctx=context();if(ctx.examplesMap?.[word]?.text)return [{lessonId:lesson.id,lessonTitle:lesson.title+' · '+ctx.examplesMap[word].label,p:null,text:ctx.examplesMap[word].text}];if(ctx.selectedSource?.includes(word))return [{lessonId:lesson.id,lessonTitle:lesson.title,p:null,text:ctx.selectedSource}];const found=[];(context().paragraphs||[]).forEach((p,i)=>{const token=p.includes(word)?word:Object.keys(window.WORD_ALIASES||{}).find(k=>window.WORD_ALIASES[k]===word&&p.includes(k));if(token){const sentence=(p.match(/[^。！？]+[。！？]?/g)||[p]).find(s=>s.includes(token));found.push({lessonId:lesson.id,lessonTitle:lesson.title,p:i+1,text:sentence||p})}});return found.slice(0,3)}
 function add(raw){reload();refreshContext();if(!lesson.id&&lessonFilter){const c=resolve(lessonFilter);lesson={...c,id:c.id}}if(!lesson.id)return {ok:false,message:'请选择课文，再加入词语。'};const word=normal(raw);if(!valid(word))return {ok:false,message:'每次输入一个词语（1—20个汉字）；也可选中原文中的词语后加入。'};let e=book.entries.find(e=>e.word===word),duplicate=!!e;const now=new Date().toISOString();if(e){e.lessons=[...new Set([...(e.lessons||[]),lesson.id])];const ex=examples(word);e.examples=[...(e.examples||[]),...ex.filter(a=>!(e.examples||[]).some(b=>b.lessonId===a.lessonId&&b.p===a.p&&b.text===a.text))].slice(0,10)}else{if(book.entries.length>=1500)return {ok:false,message:'词语本已满，请先导出备份并整理。'};const d=dictionary()[word];e={word,meaning:d?.meaning||'',en:d?.en||'',note:'',source:d?'本课语境释义':'释义待补充',examples:examples(word),lessons:[lesson.id],status:'new',createdAt:now,updatedAt:now};book.entries.unshift(e)}const d=dictionary()[word];if(d&&e.meaning&&e.meaning!==d.meaning){e.senses=e.senses||[];if(!e.senses.some(v=>v.lessonId===lesson.id&&v.meaning===d.meaning))e.senses.push({lessonId:lesson.id,meaning:d.meaning,en:d.en});}e.sources=sources(e);const source={lessonId:lesson.id,title:lesson.title,grade:lesson.grade,unit:lesson.unit};if(!e.sources.some(s=>s.lessonId===source.lessonId))e.sources.push(source);e.updatedAt=now;const saved=persist();return {ok:true,word,message:!saved?'已生成闪卡，但本机保存失败，请立即导出备份。':duplicate?'这个词已经在词语本里，已保留你的释义和复习记录。':e.meaning?'已加入词语本，自动生成含释义和原句的闪卡。':'已生成闪卡。这个词尚未收录，请在词语本里补充释义。'}}
 function list(){return book.entries.filter(e=>sources(e).some(filterSource)||(!sources(e).length&&!grade&&!unit&&!lessonFilter))}
 function open(){reload();refreshContext();if(!grade)grade=String(lesson.grade||'');lastFocus=document.activeElement;mode='list';notice='';render();const d=$('#wordDialog');if(d.showModal)d.showModal();else d.setAttribute('open','')}
 function close(){window.speechSynthesis?.cancel();$('#wordDialog').close?.();$('#wordDialog').removeAttribute('open');lastFocus?.focus?.()}
 const label=s=>({new:'新词',learning:'还不熟',known:'已记住'}[s]||'新词');
 function shell(inner){$('#wordDialogContent').innerHTML=`<h2>我的词语本</h2><p class="muted">同一浏览器中的收藏按年级、单元和课文汇总。</p><div class="notebook-nav"><button id="wordListTab" class="${mode==='list'?'active':''}">词语</button><button id="wordFlashTab" class="${mode==='flash'?'active':''}">闪卡</button><label>年级 <select id="wordGrade"><option value="">全部年级</option>${[1,2,3,4].map(g=>`<option value="${g}" ${grade===String(g)?'selected':''}>中${['','一','二','三','四'][g]}</option>`).join('')}<option value="?" ${grade==='?'?'selected':''}>未分类</option></select></label><label>单元 <select id="wordUnit"><option value="">全部单元</option>${[...new Set(catalogue.filter(c=>!grade||String(c.grade)===grade).map(c=>c.unit))].sort((a,b)=>a-b).map(u=>`<option value="${u}" ${unit===String(u)?'selected':''}>单元${u}</option>`).join('')}</select></label><label>课文 <select id="wordLesson"><option value="">全部课文</option>${catalogue.filter(c=>(!grade||String(c.grade)===grade)&&(!unit||String(c.unit)===unit)).map(c=>`<option value="${esc(c.id)}" ${lessonFilter===c.id?'selected':''}>${esc(c.title)}</option>`).join('')}</select></label><button id="thisLesson">本课</button><button id="exportWords">导出</button><label class="file-button">导入<input id="importWords" type="file" accept=".json,application/json"></label></div><p id="bookNotice" class="notice" role="status" ${notice?'':'hidden'}>${esc(notice)}</p>${inner}`;$('#wordListTab').onclick=()=>{mode='list';render()};$('#wordFlashTab').onclick=()=>{mode='flash';startDeck();render()};$('#wordGrade').onchange=e=>{grade=e.target.value;unit='';lessonFilter='';startDeck();render()};$('#wordUnit').onchange=e=>{unit=e.target.value;lessonFilter='';startDeck();render()};$('#wordLesson').onchange=e=>{lessonFilter=e.target.value;startDeck();render()};$('#thisLesson').onclick=()=>{refreshContext();grade=String(lesson.grade||'');unit=String(lesson.unit||'');lessonFilter=lesson.id;startDeck();render()};$('#exportWords').onclick=exportBook;$('#importWords').onchange=async e=>{const f=e.target.files?.[0];if(!f)return;if(f.size>2*1024*1024){notice='文件过大，请选择词语本导出的JSON备份。';render();return}try{notice=importBook(JSON.parse(await f.text()))}catch{notice='备份格式不正确，原有词语没有被替换。'}render()}}
 function render(){if(mode==='flash'){renderFlash();return}shell(`<div class="word-add-row"><input id="bookNewWord" maxlength="20" aria-label="新增词语" placeholder="输入词语"><button id="bookAdd" class="primary">加入</button></div><p class="muted">${list().length} 个词语 · 点“编辑”补充释义、英文或自己的笔记。</p><div class="notebook-list">${list().length?list().map(e=>`<article class="notebook-word"><div><h3 class="kaiti">${esc(e.word)}</h3><span class="status-tag">${e.meaning?label(e.status):'释义待补充'}</span></div><p>${esc(e.meaning||'卡片已建立，释义尚待补充。')}</p>${e.en?(englishVisible()?`<p class="word-english" lang="en">${esc(e.en)}</p>`:`<details><summary>英文提示</summary><small lang="en">${esc(e.en)}</small></details>`):''}${(e.senses||[]).filter(v=>filterSource(sourceFor(v.lessonId,e))).map(v=>`<p>本课语境义: ${esc(v.meaning)}<br><small>${esc(v.en)}</small></p>`).join('')}<p class="word-sources">${sources(e).filter(filterSource).map(v=>esc(sourceLabel(v))).join('<br>')}</p>${(e.examples||[]).filter(x=>filterSource(sourceFor(x.lessonId,e))).slice(0,1).map(x=>`<blockquote class="kaiti">${esc(x.text)}<small>${esc(x.lessonTitle)}${x.p?' · 第'+x.p+'段':''}</small></blockquote>`).join('')}<div class="action-row"><button data-edit-word="${esc(e.word)}">编辑</button><button data-hear-word="${esc(e.word)}">朗读</button></div></article>`).join(''):'<p>读课文时输入或收藏不明白的词语，它们会出现在这里。</p>'}</div>`);const collect=()=>{const r=add($('#bookNewWord').value);notice=r.message;render()};$('#bookAdd').onclick=collect;$('#bookNewWord').onkeydown=e=>{if(e.key==='Enter')collect()};document.querySelectorAll('[data-edit-word]').forEach(b=>b.onclick=()=>edit(b.dataset.editWord));wireSpeech()}
 function edit(word){let e=book.entries.find(x=>x.word===word);if(!e)return;mode='edit';shell(`<h3 class="kaiti">${esc(word)}</h3><label class="answer-label" for="editMeaning">中文释义</label><textarea id="editMeaning" rows="3" maxlength="600">${esc(e.meaning)}</textarea><label class="answer-label" for="editEnglish">英文提示（可选）</label><input class="written-input" id="editEnglish" maxlength="400" value="${esc(e.en)}"><label class="answer-label" for="editNote">笔记／例句</label><textarea id="editNote" rows="3" maxlength="1000">${esc(e.note)}</textarea><p class="muted">来源：${esc(e.source)}。不确定时请老师确认。</p><div class="action-row"><button id="saveWordEdit" class="primary">保存</button><button id="cancelWordEdit">返回</button><button id="deleteWord">删除</button></div>`);$('#saveWordEdit').onclick=()=>{reload();e=book.entries.find(x=>x.word===word);if(!e){notice='这个词已在另一页面删除。';mode='list';render();return}e.meaning=$('#editMeaning').value.trim();e.en=$('#editEnglish').value.trim();e.note=$('#editNote').value.trim();e.source=e.meaning?'我的补充':'释义待补充';e.updatedAt=new Date().toISOString();if(!e.meaning&&e.status==='known')e.status='learning';notice=persist()?'卡片已更新。':'保存失败，请导出备份。';mode='list';render()};$('#cancelWordEdit').onclick=()=>{mode='list';render()};$('#deleteWord').onclick=()=>{if(window.confirm('从词语本删除“'+word+'”？')){reload();book.entries=book.entries.filter(x=>x.word!==word);persist();mode='list';notice='已删除这个词。';render()}}}
 function startDeck(){deck=list().filter(e=>includeKnown||e.status!=='known').map(e=>e.word);for(let i=deck.length-1;i>0;i--){const j=Math.floor(Math.random()*(i+1));[deck[i],deck[j]]=[deck[j],deck[i]]}index=0;flipped=false}
 function renderFlash(){const e=book.entries.find(x=>x.word===deck[index]);shell(`<label class="notebook-filter"><input id="includeKnown" type="checkbox" ${includeKnown?'checked':''}>包括已记住的词</label>${e?`<p class="muted">${index+1} / ${deck.length} · 先回想，再翻卡</p><article class="flashcard" aria-live="polite"><p class="flash-word kaiti">${esc(e.word)}</p>${flipped?`<div class="flash-back"><p>${esc(e.meaning||'释义待补充，请先编辑卡片。')}</p>${e.en?(englishVisible()?`<p class="word-english" lang="en">${esc(e.en)}</p>`:`<details><summary>英文提示</summary><small lang="en">${esc(e.en)}</small></details>`):''}${(e.senses||[]).filter(v=>filterSource(sourceFor(v.lessonId,e))).map(v=>`<p>本课语境义: ${esc(v.meaning)}<br><small>${esc(v.en)}</small></p>`).join('')}${(e.examples||[]).filter(x=>filterSource(sourceFor(x.lessonId,e))).slice(0,2).map(x=>`<blockquote class="kaiti">${esc(x.text)}<small>${esc(x.lessonTitle)}${x.p?' · 第'+x.p+'段':''}</small></blockquote>`).join('')}${e.note?`<p class="muted">我的笔记：${esc(e.note)}</p>`:''}</div>`:'<p>这个词在这里是什么意思？</p>'}<button data-hear-word="${esc(e.word)}">朗读</button><button id="flipCard" class="primary">${flipped?'返回词面':'翻卡看释义'}</button></article>${flipped?`<div class="action-row"><button data-mastery="learning">还不熟</button>${e.meaning?'<button data-mastery="known">已记住</button>':'<button id="fixFlashWord">补充释义</button>'}</div>`:''}<div class="action-row"><button id="previousCard" ${index===0?'disabled':''}>上一张</button><button id="nextCard">${index===deck.length-1?'完成':'下一张'}</button></div>`:`<div class="flashcard"><h3>${deck.length?'本轮复习完成':'暂时没有待复习的词'}</h3><p>可以回到词语本添加词语，或重新练习还不熟的词。</p><button id="restartCards">再练一次</button></div>`}`);$('#includeKnown').onchange=e=>{includeKnown=e.target.checked;startDeck();renderFlash()};$('#flipCard')?.addEventListener('click',()=>{flipped=!flipped;renderFlash()});$('#previousCard')?.addEventListener('click',()=>{index=Math.max(0,index-1);flipped=false;renderFlash()});$('#nextCard')?.addEventListener('click',()=>{index++;flipped=false;renderFlash()});$('#restartCards')?.addEventListener('click',()=>{startDeck();renderFlash()});$('#fixFlashWord')?.addEventListener('click',()=>edit(e.word));document.querySelectorAll('[data-mastery]').forEach(b=>b.onclick=()=>{reload();const current=book.entries.find(x=>x.word===e.word);if(!current){startDeck();renderFlash();return}current.status=b.dataset.mastery;current.lastReviewed=new Date().toISOString();current.updatedAt=current.lastReviewed;notice=persist()?'':'复习记录保存失败，请导出备份。';index++;flipped=false;renderFlash()});wireSpeech()}
 function hear(word){if(!window.speechSynthesis||!window.SpeechSynthesisUtterance){$('#bookNotice').hidden=false;$('#bookNotice').textContent='设备暂不支持朗读，请阅读文字。';return}window.speechSynthesis.cancel();const u=new window.SpeechSynthesisUtterance(word);u.lang='zh-CN';u.rate=.8;u.onerror=()=>{$('#bookNotice').hidden=false;$('#bookNotice').textContent='朗读未能播放，请阅读文字。'};window.speechSynthesis.speak(u)}
 function wireSpeech(){document.querySelectorAll('[data-hear-word]').forEach(b=>b.onclick=()=>hear(b.dataset.hearWord))}
 function exportBook(){reload();const u=URL.createObjectURL(new Blob([JSON.stringify(book,null,2)],{type:'application/json;charset=utf-8'}));const a=document.createElement('a');a.href=u;a.download='华文通_我的词语本.json';a.click();setTimeout(()=>URL.revokeObjectURL(u),1000)}
 function importBook(data){if(data?.schema!==SCHEMA||!Array.isArray(data.entries)||data.entries.length>1500)throw Error('schema');reload();let added=0,merged=0,skipped=0;for(const raw of data.entries){const w=normal(raw?.word);if(!valid(w)||!raw||typeof raw!=='object'){skipped++;continue}const clip=(x,n)=>typeof x==='string'?x.slice(0,n):'';const item={sources:Array.isArray(raw.sources)?raw.sources.filter(x=>x&&typeof x.lessonId==='string').slice(0,60).map(x=>({lessonId:clip(x.lessonId,80),title:clip(x.title,150),grade:Number.isInteger(x.grade)&&x.grade>=1&&x.grade<=6?x.grade:null,unit:Number.isInteger(x.unit)&&x.unit>=1&&x.unit<=9?x.unit:null})):[],word:w,meaning:clip(raw.meaning,600),en:clip(raw.en,400),note:clip(raw.note,1000),source:'导入的个人备份',lessons:Array.isArray(raw.lessons)?raw.lessons.filter(x=>typeof x==='string').slice(0,60):[lesson.id],examples:Array.isArray(raw.examples)?raw.examples.filter(x=>x&&typeof x.text==='string').slice(0,10).map(x=>({text:clip(x.text,1500),lessonId:clip(x.lessonId,80),lessonTitle:clip(x.lessonTitle,150),p:Number.isInteger(x.p)&&x.p>=1&&x.p<=999?x.p:null})):[],senses:Array.isArray(raw.senses)?raw.senses.filter(x=>x&&typeof x.lessonId==='string'&&typeof x.meaning==='string').slice(0,60).map(x=>({lessonId:clip(x.lessonId,80),meaning:clip(x.meaning,600),en:clip(x.en,400)})):[],status:['new','learning','known'].includes(raw.status)?raw.status:'new',createdAt:clip(raw.createdAt,40),updatedAt:new Date().toISOString()};if(!item.meaning)item.status='new';const e=book.entries.find(x=>x.word===w);if(e){if(!e.meaning)e.meaning=item.meaning;if(!e.en)e.en=item.en;if(!e.note)e.note=item.note;e.lessons=[...new Set([...(e.lessons||[]),...item.lessons])];e.examples=[...(e.examples||[]),...item.examples.filter(x=>!(e.examples||[]).some(y=>x.text===y.text))].slice(0,10);e.sources=sources({...e,sources:[...(e.sources||[]),...item.sources],lessons:e.lessons});e.senses=[...(e.senses||[]),...item.senses.filter(x=>!(e.senses||[]).some(y=>x.lessonId===y.lessonId&&x.meaning===y.meaning))].slice(0,60);merged++}else if(book.entries.length<1500){book.entries.push(item);added++}else skipped++}enrichEnglish();const saved=persist();return `新增${added}个，合并${merged}个${skipped?'，跳过'+skipped+'个无效或超额条目':''}。同词保留本机已有释义。${saved?'':'本机保存失败，请导出备份。'}`}
 $('#wordDialogClose').onclick=close;window.WordBook={add,open,importBook,list,sources,context:()=>lesson};
})();
</script><script>/* Reusable textbook lesson engine. Content and stable question IDs live in content.js. */
(()=>{'use strict';
const L=window.LESSON,$=s=>document.querySelector(s),esc=s=>String(s??'').replace(/[&<>"']/g,c=>({'&':'&amp;','<':'&lt;','>':'&gt;','"':'&quot;',"'":'&#39;'}[c]));
if(L.wordEnglishVisible)document.body.classList.add('word-support-visible');
const KEY=window.LESSON_STORAGE_KEY||'huawentong-lesson-'+L.id+'-v1', cn=['一','二','三','四','五','六','七','八','九','十','十一','十二','十三','十四','十五','十六','十七','十八','十九'];
const empty=()=>({schema:'huawentong-lesson-v1',lessonId:L.id,contentVersion:L.version,sequenceVersion:L.sequenceVersion,sources:{},position:{view:'read',p:1,task:0},identity:{name:'',class:'',number:''},answers:{}});
let state=empty(),selected=null,persistFailed=false;try{const v=JSON.parse(localStorage.getItem(KEY));if(v?.lessonId===L.id&&v?.schema===state.schema)state={...state,...v,sequenceVersion:v.sequenceVersion||1}}catch{}
state.answers=state.answers||{};state.identity=state.identity||{name:'',class:'',number:''};
if(state.sequenceVersion!==L.sequenceVersion){if(Object.keys(state.answers).length){state.legacyVersions=state.legacyVersions||[];state.legacyVersions.push({version:state.contentVersion,answers:JSON.parse(JSON.stringify(state.answers))});const oldId=L.legacyOrder?.[state.position.task];const target=L.routeAliases?.[oldId]||oldId;state.position.task=Math.max(0,L.tasks.findIndex(t=>t.id===target));}state.sequenceVersion=L.sequenceVersion;state.contentVersion=L.version;}
state.sources=state.sources||{};
const save=()=>{try{localStorage.setItem(KEY,JSON.stringify(state));persistFailed=false}catch{persistFailed=true}const n=$('#saveState');if(n)n.textContent=persistFailed?'保存失败，请导出记录':'已保存';window.dispatchEvent(new CustomEvent('hwt:lesson-saved'));};
const a=id=>state.answers[id]||(state.answers[id]={fields:{},choices:{},evidence:{},attempts:[],hintCount:0,revision:'',points:[],unlocked:false});
const allFields=t=>[...(t.fields||[]),...(t.answerTable?.fields||[])];
function fieldInput(f,x,label=f.label,limit=5000){return f.type==='select'?`<select id="field-${esc(f.id)}" data-field="${esc(f.id)}" aria-label="${esc(label)}"><option value="">请选择</option>${(f.options||[]).map(v=>`<option value="${esc(v)}" ${x.fields[f.id]===v?'selected':''}>${esc(v)}</option>`).join('')}</select>`:`<textarea id="field-${esc(f.id)}" data-field="${esc(f.id)}" rows="3" maxlength="${limit}" aria-label="${esc(label)}" placeholder="${esc(f.placeholder||'')}">${esc(x.fields[f.id]||'')}</textarea>`}
const task=()=>L.tasks[Math.max(0,Math.min(L.tasks.length-1,state.position.task))];
function kw(s,words=[]){let result=esc(s);[...words].sort((a,b)=>b.length-a.length).forEach(w=>result=result.split(esc(w)).join('<span class="key">'+esc(w)+'</span>'));return result}
function panel(n){if(L.panelImages?.[n-1]){const path=L.panelImages[n-1],src=window.LESSON_ASSETS?.[path]||path,r=L.panelRects[n-1];return `<div class="panel panel-direct"><img src="${esc(src)}" alt="原有漫画第${n}格" width="${r[2]}" height="${r[3]}" loading="eager" decoding="async"></div>`}const r=L.panelRects[n-1],sheet=L.panelSheets?.[n-1]||Math.ceil(n/10),src=window.LESSON_ASSETS?.['comic'+sheet]||'assets/comic'+sheet+'.png';return `<div class="panel" style="aspect-ratio:${r[2]}/${r[3]}"><img src="${src}" alt="原有漫画第${n}格" style="width:${1024/r[2]*100}%;left:${-r[0]/r[2]*100}%;top:${-r[1]/r[3]*100}%" loading="lazy"></div>`}
const pName=p=>'第'+(cn[p-1]||p)+(L.unitNoun||'段');
const sentences=p=>L.paragraphs[p-1].match(/[^。！？]+[。！？][”’]?|[^。！？]+$/g)||[L.paragraphs[p-1]];
function marked(s){const aliases=window.WORD_ALIASES||{},words=[...Object.keys(window.LESSON_WORDS),...Object.keys(aliases)].filter(w=>s.includes(w)).sort((a,b)=>b.length-a.length);if(!words.length)return esc(s);const re=new RegExp('('+words.join('|')+')','g');return s.split(re).map(v=>window.LESSON_WORDS[aliases[v]||v]?`<span class="word" role="button" tabindex="0" data-word="${esc(aliases[v]||v)}">${esc(v)}</span>`:esc(v)).join('')}
function figure(p){const f=L.figures?.[p];if(!f)return '';let body='';
const sourceImage=()=>{const r=f.rect;if(f.directSrc){const src=window.LESSON_ASSETS?.[f.directSrc]||f.directSrc;return `<div class="panel panel-direct"><img src="${esc(src)}" alt="${esc(f.alt||f.title)}" width="${r[2]}" height="${r[3]}" loading="eager" decoding="async"></div>`}const src=window.LESSON_ASSETS?.[f.src]||f.src;return `<div class="figure-crop" style="aspect-ratio:${r[2]}/${r[3]}"><img src="${esc(src)}" alt="${esc(f.alt||f.title)}" style="width:${f.imageWidth/r[2]*100}%;left:${-r[0]/r[2]*100}%;top:${-r[1]/r[3]*100}%" loading="lazy"></div>`};
if(f.kind==='sourceImage'||f.kind==='diagram'){body=sourceImage();if(f.rows)body+='<div class="diagram-text">'+f.rows.map(r=>'<p><strong>'+esc(r[0])+'</strong>：'+esc(r[1])+'</p>').join('')+'</div>';return '<figure class="data-figure"><figcaption>'+esc(f.title)+'</figcaption>'+body+'<p class="data-note">'+esc(f.note)+'</p></figure>';}
if(f.kind==='pie'){const colors=['#337951','#7f8d72','#efd967','#b0c64f','#cc635f'];let a=-Math.PI/2;body='<svg viewBox="0 0 200 200" role="img" aria-label="'+esc(f.title)+'">';f.rows.forEach((r,i)=>{const next=a+Number(r[1])/100*Math.PI*2;body+=`<path d="M100 100 L${100+88*Math.cos(a)} ${100+88*Math.sin(a)} A88 88 0 ${next-a>Math.PI?1:0} 1 ${100+88*Math.cos(next)} ${100+88*Math.sin(next)} Z" fill="${colors[i]}" stroke="white" stroke-width="1.5"/>`;a=next});body+='</svg><table><thead><tr><th>类别</th><th>比例</th></tr></thead><tbody>'+f.rows.map((r,i)=>'<tr><td><span class="chart-key" style="background:'+colors[i]+'"></span>'+esc(r[0])+'</td><td>'+esc(r[1])+'%</td></tr>').join('')+'</tbody></table>';return '<figure class="data-figure"><figcaption>'+esc(f.title)+'</figcaption>'+body+'<p class="data-note">'+esc(f.note)+'</p></figure>';}
if(f.kind==='table'){body='<table><thead><tr>'+f.headers.map(x=>'<th>'+esc(x)+'</th>').join('')+'</tr></thead><tbody>'+f.rows.map(r=>'<tr>'+r.map(x=>'<td>'+esc(x)+'</td>').join('')+'</tr>').join('')+'</tbody></table>'}else{const max=f.kind==='share'?100:f.kind==='bars'?30:180;body=f.rows.map((r,i)=>'<div class="bar-row"><span>'+esc(r[0])+'</span><span class="bar-track" aria-hidden="true"><span class="bar-fill '+(f.kind==='trend'&&i===f.rows.length-1?'target-bar':'')+'" style="width:'+(Number(r[1])/max*100)+'%"></span></span><strong>'+esc(r[1])+(f.unit==='%'?'%':'')+'</strong></div>').join('');if(f.unit!=='%')body+='<p>单位：'+esc(f.unit)+'／人／日</p>'}return '<figure class="data-figure"><figcaption>'+esc(f.title)+'</figcaption>'+body+'<p class="data-note">'+esc(f.note)+'</p></figure>'}
function paragraph(p,selectable){return `<section class="source-paragraph" id="p${p}"><h3>${pName(p)}${L.paragraphLabels?.[p-1]?" · "+esc(L.paragraphLabels[p-1]):""}</h3><div class="source-text">${sentences(p).map((s,i)=>selectable?`<span class="sentence" tabindex="0" role="button" data-p="${p}" data-i="${i}" draggable="true">${L.wordEnglishVisible?marked(s):esc(s)}</span>`:marked(s)).join('')}</div>${figure(p)}</section>`}
function range(t){if(t.range.length===2)return Array.from({length:t.range[1]-t.range[0]+1},(_,i)=>t.range[0]+i);return t.range}
function route(){let h=location.hash.slice(1);if(h.startsWith('task-'))h='task-'+(L.routeAliases?.[h.slice(5)]||h.slice(5));if(h==='read')state.position={...state.position,view:'read'};if(/^paragraph-\d+$/.test(h)){state.position.view='read';state.position.p=Math.max(1,Math.min(L.paragraphs.length,+h.split('-')[1]))}if(/^lesson[123]$/.test(h)){state.position.view='task';state.position.task=L.tasks.findIndex(t=>t.lesson===+h.slice(-1))}const ti=L.tasks.findIndex(t=>'task-'+t.id===h);if(ti>=0){state.position.view='task';state.position.task=ti}if(h==='review')state.position.view='review';render();save();if(h==='words')window.WordBook.open()}
function go(hash){window.speechSynthesis?.cancel();selected=null;if(location.hash.slice(1)===hash)route();else location.hash=hash;window.scrollTo?.({top:0,behavior:'instant'})}
function render(){const view=state.position.view;$('#readTask').hidden=view==='review';$('#review').hidden=view!=='review';document.querySelectorAll('[data-view]').forEach(b=>b.classList.toggle('active',b.dataset.view===(view==='task'?'lesson'+task().lesson:view)));if(view==='review'){review();return}if(view==='read')read();else activity()}
function read(){const p=state.position.p;$('#source').innerHTML=`<div class="toolbar"><button id="prevPara" ${p===1?'disabled':''}>上一${L.unitNoun||'段'}</button><select id="paragraphSelect" aria-label="选择${L.unitNoun||'段落'}">${L.paragraphs.map((_,i)=>`<option value="${i+1}" ${p===i+1?'selected':''}>${pName(i+1)}</option>`).join('')}</select><button id="nextPara">${p===L.paragraphs.length?(L.unitNoun?'本课问题':'段落练习'):('下一'+(L.unitNoun||'段'))}</button></div>${paragraph(p,false)}<div class="toolbar"><button id="readAloud">朗读</button><button id="stopAudio">停止</button></div><p id="audioState" class="muted" role="status"></p>${L.paragraphTasks?.[p-1]?`<p><button id="paragraphTask">本${L.unitNoun||'段'}问题</button></p>`:""}<details class="paragraph-idea"><summary>${L.unitNoun?'本'+L.unitNoun+'要点':'段落要点'}</summary><p class="kai">${esc(L.paragraphIdeas[p-1])}</p></details>`;
$('#activity').innerHTML=`<h2 class="para-name">${pName(p)}</h2><div class="panel-list">${L.panels[p-1].map(panel).join('')}</div><div class="word-add-row"><input id="newWord" maxlength="20" placeholder="输入词语" aria-label="输入不明白的词语"><button id="addWord">加入词语本</button></div><div class="actions"><button id="openWords">词语本</button></div><p id="wordNotice" role="status"></p>`;
$('#paragraphTask')?.addEventListener('click',()=>go('task-'+L.paragraphTasks[p-1]));$('#paragraphSelect').onchange=e=>go('paragraph-'+e.target.value);$('#prevPara').onclick=()=>go('paragraph-'+(p-1));$('#nextPara').onclick=()=>go(p===L.paragraphs.length?'lesson1':'paragraph-'+(p+1));$('#readAloud').onclick=()=>speak(L.paragraphs[p-1],$('#audioState'));$('#stopAudio').onclick=()=>{window.speechSynthesis?.cancel();$('#audioState').textContent='已停止'};const add=()=>{$('#wordNotice').textContent=window.WordBook.add($('#newWord').value).message};$('#addWord').onclick=add;$('#newWord').onkeydown=e=>{if(e.key==='Enter')add()};$('#openWords').onclick=()=>window.WordBook.open()}
function concept(t){if(t.conceptNotes?.length)return `<section class="concept">${t.conceptNotes.map(([name,explanation])=>`<p><b>${esc(name)}</b>：${esc(explanation)}</p>`).join('')}</section>`;switch(t.concept){case'idioms':return `<section class="concept"><p><b>惯用语</b>（idiom）：有固定比喻义的习惯用语。</p><dl class="idiom-list">${L.idioms.map(([w,m,en])=>`<dt>${esc(w)}</dt><dd>${esc(m)}${L.wordEnglishVisible&&en?`<p class="word-english" lang="en">${esc(en)}</p>`:""}</dd>`).join('')}</dl></section>`;case'description':return `<section class="concept"><p><b>语言描写</b>（dialogue）：说出口的话。<br><b>心理描写</b>（psychological description）：心里的想法。</p></section>`;case'effect':return `<section class="concept"><p><b>表达作用</b>（effect）：写出了什么？突出到什么程度？</p></section>`;case'character':return `<section class="concept"><p><b>特点＋依据＋解释</b></p><p>比较同一情境，说明具体行为反映什么特点。</p></section>`;case'open':return `<section class="concept"><p><b>立场</b>：我怎么看？<br><b>理由</b>：为什么？<br><b>例子</b>：什么事能说明？<br><b>回扣</b>（link back）：例子怎样支持看法？</p></section>`;default:return''}}
function activity(){const t=task(),x=a(t.id),ps=state.sources[t.id]?[state.sources[t.id]]:(t.focus||range(t));$('#source').innerHTML=`<div class="toolbar"><label for="taskSelect">${L.unitNoun?'图文问题':'段落问题'}</label><select id="taskSelect">${L.tasks.map((t,i)=>`<option value="${t.id}" ${i===state.position.task?'selected':''}>${esc(t.title)}</option>`).join('')}</select></div><p class="guide">${(L.unitNoun||L.simpleTaskGuide)&&!t.evidence?.length?'先看左边图文，再回答右边问题。':'点原句，再点“加入原句”。可连续加入多句，也可直接粘贴、修改。'}</p>${range(t).length>ps.length?`<label class="reference-nav">回看原文 <select id="sourceSelect">${range(t).map(p=>`<option value="${p}" ${ps.includes(p)?'selected':''}>${pName(p)}</option>`).join('')}</select></label>`:''}${ps.map(p=>paragraph(p,true)).join('')}`;
let form=(t.evidence||[]).map((e,i)=>`<div class="evidence-row"><label class="evidence-label" for="evidence-${i}">${esc(e.label)}</label><textarea class="evidence-input" id="evidence-${i}" data-evidence="${i}" rows="4" maxlength="12000" placeholder="可加入多句原文，也可复制、粘贴。">${esc(x.evidence[i]?.text||'')}</textarea><div class="actions"><button data-slot="${i}">加入原句</button><button data-remove="${i}">清空</button></div></div>`).join('');
form+=(t.checks||[]).map(c=>`<fieldset><legend>${esc(c.question)}</legend>${c.options.map((op,i)=>`<label class="option ${String(x.choices[c.id])===String(i)?'chosen':''}"><input type="radio" name="${c.id}" value="${i}" ${String(x.choices[c.id])===String(i)?'checked':''}><span>${'ABCD'[i]}. ${esc(op)}</span></label>`).join('')}</fieldset>`).join('');
if(t.blanks){if(!x.wordOrder){x.wordOrder=t.bank?[...t.bank]:L.idioms.map(x=>x[0]);for(let i=x.wordOrder.length-1;i>0;i--){const j=Math.floor(Math.random()*(i+1));[x.wordOrder[i],x.wordOrder[j]]=[x.wordOrder[j],x.wordOrder[i]]}save()}form+=t.blanks.map((b,i)=>`<div class="blank-row">${i+1}. ${esc(b.before)} <select data-blank="${b.id}" aria-label="第${i+1}空"><option value="">请选择</option>${x.wordOrder.map(w=>`<option ${x.choices[b.id]===w?'selected':''}>${esc(w)}</option>`).join('')}</select> ${esc(b.after)}</div>`).join('')}
if(t.summaryRow)form+=`<table><tr><th>动物</th><th>概括主要特点</th></tr><tr><td>${esc(t.summaryRow)}</td><td><textarea id="summaryAnswer" aria-label="概括主要特点" maxlength="2000" rows="3" placeholder="先口头概括；需要记录时可填写。">${esc(x.summary||'')}</textarea></td></tr></table>`;
if(t.answerTable){const tb=t.answerTable;form+=`<p class="guide">${esc(tb.note||'')}</p><table class="answer-table"><thead><tr>${tb.headers.map(h=>`<th>${esc(h)}</th>`).join('')}</tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">${esc(tb.name)}</th>${tb.fields.map(f=>`<td data-label="${esc(f.label)}">${fieldInput(f,x,tb.name+'：'+f.label,3000)}</td>`).join('')}</tr></tbody></table>`;}
form+=(t.fields||[]).map(f=>`<label class="answer-label" for="field-${esc(f.id)}">${esc(f.label)}</label>${fieldInput(f,x)}`).join('');
$('#activity').innerHTML=`<div class="eyebrow">${['','第一课','第二课','第三课'][t.lesson]} · ${t.scope==='full'?'全文综合':(t.order<=16?(t.focus||[]).map(pName).join('、'):'全文综合')}${t.required?' · 必做':''}</div><h2>${esc(t.title)}</h2>${t.questions.map(q=>`<p class="question">${kw(q,t.keywords)}</p>`).join('')}<p class="guide">${esc(t.guide)}</p>${concept(t)}${t.examples?.length?'<details><summary>课本例句</summary><table><tr><th>例句</th><th>用语</th></tr>'+t.examples.map(r=>'<tr><td>'+esc(r[0])+'</td><td>'+esc(r[1])+'</td></tr>').join('')+'</table></details>':''}${t.resources?.length?`<div class="actions">${t.resources.map(r=>`<a class="btn" href="https://huawentong-home.lyqlym2015.workers.dev/du/textbook/2hcl/unit6/jiaxinxi/${esc(r.url)}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">${esc(r.label)}</a>`).join('')}</div>`:''}${form}<div class="actions"><button id="submit" class="primary">${t.mode==='oral'?'展开讲评':t.mode==='objective'?'检查':'提交比较'}</button><button id="hint">提示</button></div><div id="feedback" role="status"></div><div id="solution">${x.unlocked?solution(t,x):''}</div><p class="question-source">${esc(t.source)}</p><div class="task-footer"><button id="prevTask" ${state.position.task===0?'disabled':''}>上一题</button><button id="nextTask">${state.position.task===L.tasks.length-1?'检查':'下一题'}</button></div>`;
$('#summaryAnswer')?.addEventListener('input',e=>{x.summary=e.target.value;save()});$('#sourceSelect')?.addEventListener('change',e=>{state.sources[t.id]=+e.target.value;save();activity()});document.querySelectorAll('[data-evidence]').forEach(e=>e.oninput=()=>{x.evidence[e.dataset.evidence]={text:e.value,items:parseEvidence(e.value)};save()});$('#taskSelect').onchange=e=>go('task-'+e.target.value);document.querySelectorAll('input[type=radio]').forEach(el=>el.onchange=()=>{x.choices[el.name]=+el.value;save();el.closest('fieldset').querySelectorAll('.option').forEach(n=>n.classList.toggle('chosen',n.querySelector('input').checked))});document.querySelectorAll('[data-blank]').forEach(el=>el.onchange=()=>{x.choices[el.dataset.blank]=el.value;save()});document.querySelectorAll('[data-field]').forEach(el=>el.oninput=()=>{x.fields[el.dataset.field]=el.value;save()});
document.querySelectorAll('[data-slot]').forEach(b=>{b.onclick=()=>put(+b.dataset.slot);b.ondragover=e=>e.preventDefault();b.ondrop=e=>{e.preventDefault();try{const v=JSON.parse(e.dataTransfer.getData('text/plain'));if(valid(v))selected=v}catch{}put(+b.dataset.slot)}});document.querySelectorAll('[data-remove]').forEach(b=>b.onclick=()=>{delete x.evidence[b.dataset.remove];save();activity()});$('#submit').onclick=check;$('#hint').onclick=()=>{x.hintCount++;save();feedback(t.hints[Math.min(x.hintCount-1,t.hints.length-1)])};$('#prevTask').onclick=()=>go('task-'+L.tasks[state.position.task-1].id);$('#nextTask').onclick=()=>{if(t.required&&!x.first){feedback(t.requiredMessage||(t.answerTable?'请先完成本题的必填表格。':'请先完成理由、例子和回扣。'));return}go(state.position.task===L.tasks.length-1?'review':'task-'+L.tasks[state.position.task+1].id)};wireSolution(t,x);applyLock(x)}
function parseEvidence(raw){const clean=String(raw||'').replace(/^第[一二三四五六七八九十\d]+(?:段|部分)\s*/gm,'').trim();if(!clean)return [];const chunks=clean.match(/[^。！？]+[。！？][”’]?|[^。！？]+$/g)||[];const out=[];for(const chunk of chunks){const text=chunk.trim();if(!text)continue;const p=L.paragraphs.findIndex(v=>v.includes(text));if(p<0)return [];out.push({p:p+1,text});}return out}
function valid(v){return typeof v?.text==='string'&&parseEvidence(v.text).length>0}
function put(i){if(!valid(selected)){feedback('先点选左边的原句。');return}const x=a(task().id),previous=x.evidence[i]?.text||'',items=parseEvidence(previous);if(!items.some(e=>e.p===selected.p&&e.text===selected.text)){x.evidence[i]={text:previous+(previous?'\n':'')+selected.text};x.evidence[i].items=parseEvidence(x.evidence[i].text);}save();selected=null;activity()}
const match=(v,r)=>valid(v)&&parseEvidence(v.text).some(e=>r.p.includes(e.p)&&r.terms.some(s=>e.text.includes(s)))&&(!r.requiredTerms||r.requiredTerms.every(s=>v.text.includes(s)));
function objective(t,x){return (t.checks||[]).every(c=>x.choices[c.id]===c.correct)&&(t.blanks||[]).every(b=>x.choices[b.id]===b.answer)&&(t.evidence||[]).every((r,i)=>match(x.evidence[i],r))&&allFields(t).filter(f=>f.type==='select'&&f.correct!==undefined).every(f=>x.fields[f.id]===f.correct)}
function feedback(s,ok=false){$('#feedback').innerHTML=`<p class="${ok?'success':'notice'}">${esc(s)}</p>`}
function applyLock(x){const b=$('#submit');if(!b)return;const delay=Math.max(0,(x.lockUntil||0)-Date.now());b.disabled=!!delay;if(delay){const id=task().id;setTimeout(()=>{if(state.position.view==='task'&&task().id===id)applyLock(x)},delay+20)}}
function check(){const t=task(),x=a(t.id);if(t.mode==='oral'){if(window.HWTTextbookConnection&&!x.first){x.first={fields:{},choices:{},evidence:{},timestamp:new Date().toISOString(),assisted:x.hintCount>0};x.firstCorrect=null;}x.unlocked=true;save();activity();return}if(Date.now()<(x.lockUntil||0))return;if((t.checks||[]).some(c=>x.choices[c.id]===undefined)||(t.blanks||[]).some(b=>!x.choices[b.id])){feedback('请完成点选。');return}if((t.evidence||[]).some((e,i)=>!valid(x.evidence[i]))){feedback('请在每个证据框加入原句。');return}if(allFields(t).some(f=>!f.optional&&!x.fields[f.id]?.trim())){feedback('请补齐回答。');return}
const snapshot={summary:x.summary||'',fields:JSON.parse(JSON.stringify(x.fields)),choices:{...x.choices},evidence:JSON.parse(JSON.stringify(x.evidence)),timestamp:new Date().toISOString(),assisted:x.hintCount>0};const correct=t.mode==='objective'?objective(t,x):(t.checks||[]).every(c=>x.choices[c.id]===c.correct);if(!x.first){x.first=snapshot;x.firstCorrect=t.mode==='objective'?correct:null}x.attempts.push({...snapshot,correct:t.mode==='objective'?correct:null});
if(correct){x.unlocked=true;save();feedback(t.mode==='objective'?(L.objectiveSuccess||'回答正确，请核对依据和解释。'):'已保存，请对照意思与依据后订正。主观题由教师核对。',true);$('#solution').innerHTML=solution(t,x);wireSolution(t,x);return}
x.lockUntil=Date.now()+5000;save();feedback(t.hints[Math.min(x.attempts.length-1,t.hints.length-1)]);applyLock(x);if(x.attempts.length>=2){const b=document.createElement('button');b.textContent='看讲解';b.disabled=true;$('#feedback').append(b);const id=t.id;setTimeout(()=>{if(task().id===id)b.disabled=false},5000);b.onclick=()=>{if(Date.now()<x.lockUntil)return;x.unlocked=true;x.guided=true;save();activity()}}}
function solution(t,x){return `<section class="solution"><h3>对照</h3><p>${esc(t.explain)}</p>${t.checks?.length?`<details><summary>选项解析</summary>${t.checks.map(c=>`<h4 class="kai">${esc(c.question)}</h4>${c.options.map((o,i)=>`<p>${'ABCD'[i]}. ${esc(c.why[i])}${i===c.correct?' ✓':''}</p>`).join('')}`).join('')}</details>`:''}<h3>参考答案</h3><p class="model">${esc(t.answer)}</p>${(t.alternatives||[]).map(s=>`<p>${esc(s)}</p>`).join('')}<details><summary>易错点</summary><p>${esc(t.reject)}</p></details><div class="selfcheck"><h3>自检</h3>${t.points.map((p,i)=>`<label><input type="checkbox" data-point="${i}" ${x.points.includes(i)?'checked':''}>${esc(p)}</label>`).join('')}<small>自检不等于评分。</small></div>${(allFields(t).length||t.summaryRow)?`<h3>首次回答</h3><p class="model">${[x.first?.summary||'',...Object.values(x.first?.fields||{})].filter(Boolean).map(esc).join('<br>')||'本题采用口头概括。'}</p><label class="answer-label" for="revision">订正</label><textarea id="revision" maxlength="10000" rows="4">${esc(x.revision)}</textarea>`:''}${t.oral?`<div class="oral-block"><h3>口头追问</h3>${t.oral.map(([q,ans])=>`<p class="question">${esc(q)}</p><details><summary>展开参考</summary><p>${esc(ans)}</p></details>`).join('')}</div>`:''}</section>`}
function wireSolution(t,x){$('#revision')?.addEventListener('input',e=>{x.revision=e.target.value;save()});document.querySelectorAll('[data-point]').forEach(b=>b.onchange=()=>{const s=new Set(x.points);b.checked?s.add(+b.dataset.point):s.delete(+b.dataset.point);x.points=[...s];save()})}
function review(){const objectiveTasks=L.tasks.filter(t=>t.mode==='objective'),attempted=objectiveTasks.filter(t=>a(t.id).first),correct=attempted.filter(t=>a(t.id).firstCorrect).length,required=L.tasks.filter(t=>t.required&&!a(t.id).first);$('#review').innerHTML=`<h2>学习记录</h2><p class="muted">记录保存在当前设备，可导出备份。</p><div class="identity">${[['name','姓名'],['class','班级'],['number','学号／组别']].map(([k,label])=>`<label>${label}<input data-identity="${k}" maxlength="60" value="${esc(state.identity[k]||'')}"></label>`).join('')}</div>${state.legacyVersions?.length?'<p class="muted">旧版回答已保留在完整备份中。拆开的题目重新作答，不把旧答案套入新题。</p>':''}${required.map(t=>`<p class="notice">必做题未完成 <button data-go="${t.id}">${esc(t.title)}</button></p>`).join('')}<p>${esc(L.accuracyLabel||'客观题首次正确率')}: ${attempted.length?Math.round(correct/attempted.length*100)+'%':'—'} (${correct}/${attempted.length})</p><p class="muted">主观题由教师核对，不计入自动正确率。</p>${L.tasks.map((t,i)=>`<div class="record-row"><span>${esc(t.title)}</span><small>${a(t.id).unlocked?'已对照':a(t.id).first?'待订正':'未提交'}</small><button data-go="${t.id}">返回</button></div>`).join('')}<div class="actions"><button id="downloadJSON">完整备份</button><button id="downloadCSV">逐题记录</button><button id="downloadText">文字记录</button><button id="resetLesson">重置本课</button></div>${L.tasks.filter(t=>allFields(t).length).map(t=>{const x=a(t.id);return `<section class="record"><h3>${esc(t.title)}</h3><h4>首次回答</h4><p class="kai">${esc(Object.values(x.first?.fields||{}).join('\n')||'未提交')}</p><h4>订正</h4><p class="kai">${esc(x.revision||'—')}</p></section>`}).join('')}`;document.querySelectorAll('[data-identity]').forEach(e=>e.oninput=()=>{state.identity[e.dataset.identity]=e.value;save()});document.querySelectorAll('[data-go]').forEach(b=>b.onclick=()=>go('task-'+b.dataset.go));$('#downloadJSON').onclick=()=>download(L.title+'_学习记录.json',JSON.stringify(state,null,2),'application/json');$('#downloadText').onclick=exportText;$('#downloadCSV').onclick=exportCSV;$('#resetLesson').onclick=()=>{dialog(`<h2>重置本课？</h2><p>请先导出备份。重置本课会保留词语本。</p><div class="actions"><button id="backupReset">先备份</button><button id="confirmReset">确认重置</button></div>`);$('#backupReset').onclick=()=>download(L.title+'_学习记录.json',JSON.stringify(state,null,2),'application/json');$('#confirmReset').onclick=()=>{state=empty();save();closeDialog();go('read')}}}
function download(name,body,type='text/plain;charset=utf-8'){const u=URL.createObjectURL(new Blob([body],{type})),link=document.createElement('a');link.href=u;link.download=name;link.click();setTimeout(()=>URL.revokeObjectURL(u),1000)}
function exportText(){const lines=[...(state.legacyVersions?.length?['旧版记录：'+JSON.stringify(state.legacyVersions)]:[]),L.label+'《'+L.title+'》',JSON.stringify(state.identity),'主观题未自动评分。'];L.tasks.forEach(t=>{const x=a(t.id);lines.push('\n'+t.title,...t.questions,'首次：'+JSON.stringify(x.first||{}),'订正：'+x.revision,'尝试记录：'+JSON.stringify(x.attempts),'自检：'+JSON.stringify(x.points))});download(L.title+'_学习记录.txt',lines.join('\n'))}
function exportCSV(){const rows=[['lesson','name','class','number','task_id','question','first_answer','first_choices','first_evidence','first_correct','timestamp','attempts','revision','selfcheck','reviewed','first_summary','current_summary']];L.tasks.forEach(t=>{const x=a(t.id);rows.push([L.id,state.identity.name,state.identity.class,state.identity.number,t.id,t.questions.join('；'),JSON.stringify(x.first?.fields||{}),JSON.stringify(x.first?.choices||{}),JSON.stringify(x.first?.evidence||{}),x.firstCorrect===null||x.firstCorrect===undefined?'not_auto_graded':String(x.firstCorrect),x.first?.timestamp||'',JSON.stringify(x.attempts),x.revision,JSON.stringify(x.points),String(x.unlocked),x.first?.summary||'',x.summary||''])});const cell=v=>'"'+String(v??'').replace(/^[=+@-]/,"'$&").replace(/"/g,'""')+'"';download(L.title+'_逐题记录.csv','\uFEFF'+rows.map(r=>r.map(cell).join(',')).join('\r\n'),'text/csv;charset=utf-8')}
function dialog(html){$('#dialogContent').innerHTML=html;$('#dialog').showModal?.();if(!$('#dialog').open)$('#dialog').setAttribute('open','')}
function closeDialog(){window.speechSynthesis?.cancel();$('#dialog').close?.();$('#dialog').removeAttribute('open')}
function speak(s,n){if(!window.speechSynthesis||!window.SpeechSynthesisUtterance){if(n)n.textContent='设备不支持朗读';return}window.speechSynthesis.cancel();const u=new SpeechSynthesisUtterance(s);u.lang='zh-CN';u.rate=.85;if(n)n.textContent='设备朗读';u.onerror=()=>{if(n)n.textContent='朗读失败'};window.speechSynthesis.speak(u)}
document.addEventListener('click',e=>{const w=e.target.closest('[data-word]');if(w){const term=w.dataset.word,d=window.LESSON_WORDS[term];dialog(`<h2 class="kai">${esc(term)}</h2><p>${esc(d.meaning)}</p>${d.en?(L.wordEnglishVisible?`<p class="word-english" lang="en">${esc(d.en)}</p>`:`<details><summary>英文提示</summary><p>${esc(d.en)}</p></details>`):``}<button id="collectWord">加入词语本</button><p id="collectNotice"></p>`);$('#collectWord').onclick=()=>{$('#collectNotice').textContent=window.WordBook.add(term).message};return}const s=e.target.closest('.sentence');if(s){selected={p:+s.dataset.p,text:sentences(+s.dataset.p)[+s.dataset.i]};document.querySelectorAll('.sentence.selected').forEach(n=>n.classList.remove('selected'));s.classList.add('selected')}});
document.addEventListener('keydown',e=>{if(['Enter',' '].includes(e.key)&&e.target.matches('.sentence,[data-word]')){e.preventDefault();e.target.click()}});document.addEventListener('dragstart',e=>{const s=e.target.closest('.sentence');if(s)e.dataTransfer.setData('text/plain',JSON.stringify({p:+s.dataset.p,text:sentences(+s.dataset.p)[+s.dataset.i]}))});
$('#dialogClose').onclick=closeDialog;document.querySelectorAll('[data-view]').forEach(b=>b.onclick=()=>go(b.dataset.view));$('#wordList').onclick=()=>window.WordBook.open();window.addEventListener('hashchange',route);window.LessonEngine={state:()=>state,valid,objective,range,panel,save,restore:v=>{if(v?.lessonId!==L.id||v?.schema!==state.schema)throw Error('记录不属于本课');state=v;save();render()}};route();
})();

</script><script>/* Uses the shared lesson record; no separate student identity store. */
(()=>{const host=document.querySelector('#topIdentity'),state=()=>window.LessonEngine.state(),key=window.LESSON_STORAGE_KEY||'huawentong-lesson-'+window.LESSON.id+'-v1';for(const [name,label]of [['name','姓名'],['class','班级'],['number','学号／组别']]){const l=document.createElement('label');l.textContent=label;const i=document.createElement('input');i.maxLength=60;i.value=state().identity[name]||'';i.setAttribute('aria-label',label);i.oninput=()=>{state().identity[name]=i.value;try{localStorage.setItem(key,JSON.stringify(state()));document.querySelector('#saveState').textContent='已保存'}catch{document.querySelector('#saveState').textContent='保存失败，请导出记录'}};l.append(i);host.append(l)}window.addEventListener('hashchange',()=>{host.querySelectorAll('input').forEach((i,n)=>i.value=state().identity[['name','class','number'][n]]||'')})})();


</script><script>(()=>{'use strict';const L=window.LESSON,A=document.querySelector('#activity'),S=document.querySelector('#source'),K=window.LESSON_STORAGE_KEY||'huawentong-lesson-'+L.id+'-v1';
function go(h){window.speechSynthesis?.cancel();location.hash=h;window.scrollTo({top:0,behavior:'instant'})}
function enhance(){const state=window.LessonEngine.state();if(state.position.view==='read'){const p=state.position.p;const next=document.querySelector('#nextPara');next.textContent='本段问题';next.onclick=()=>go('task-'+L.paragraphTasks[p-1]);if(!A.querySelector('.panel-nav')){const list=A.querySelector('.panel-list'),panels=[...list.querySelectorAll('.panel')];if(panels.length>1){state.picturePositions=state.picturePositions||{};let index=Math.min(panels.length-1,state.picturePositions[p]||0);const nav=document.createElement('div');nav.className='panel-nav';const prev=document.createElement('button'),label=document.createElement('span'),forward=document.createElement('button');prev.textContent='上一格';forward.textContent='下一格';nav.append(prev,label,forward);list.after(nav);const show=()=>{panels.forEach((n,i)=>n.hidden=i!==index);prev.disabled=index===0;forward.disabled=index===panels.length-1;label.textContent='本段漫画 '+(index+1)+' / '+panels.length;state.picturePositions[p]=index;try{localStorage.setItem(K,JSON.stringify(state))}catch{}};prev.onclick=()=>{index--;show()};forward.onclick=()=>{index++;show()};show();}}if(!A.querySelector('.word-support')){const section=document.createElement('section');section.className='word-support';const h=document.createElement('b');h.textContent='本段词语';section.append(h);for(const[w,v]of Object.entries(window.LESSON_WORDS)){if(v.paragraph!==p)continue;const b=document.createElement('button');b.className='word';b.dataset.word=w;b.textContent=w;section.append(b)}A.querySelector('.word-add-row').before(section)}}
if(state.position.view==='task'){enhanceTask(state);const t=L.tasks[state.position.task],next=document.querySelector('#nextTask'),after={'p1-view':2,'p2-cause':3,'p3-example':4,'p4-tech':5,'p5-mislead':6,'p6-harm':7,'p7-sentence':8};if(after[t.id]){next.textContent='继续读第'+after[t.id]+'段';next.onclick=()=>go('paragraph-'+after[t.id])}if(!A.querySelector('.sequence-nav')){const d=document.createElement('div');d.className='sequence-nav';const a=document.createElement('a');a.className='btn';a.href='#paragraph-'+t.focus[0];a.textContent='回到图文';d.append(a);A.querySelector('.task-footer').before(d)}}}

function enhanceTask(state){
 const t=L.tasks[state.position.task];
 if(!t.orderCards)for(const sel of A.querySelectorAll('[data-blank]')){if(sel.dataset.fullChoice)continue;sel.dataset.fullChoice='yes';const preview=document.createElement('p');preview.className='selected-meaning';preview.style.cssText='font-size:20px;line-height:1.5;color:var(--green)';sel.after(preview);const draw=()=>{preview.textContent=sel.value?'已选：'+sel.value:''};sel.addEventListener('change',draw);draw()}
 if(t.id==='whole-structure'&&!A.querySelector('.original-table')){
  const rows=[...A.querySelectorAll('.blank-row')],table=document.createElement('table');table.className='original-table';
  table.innerHTML='<thead><tr><th>结构与段落</th><th>主要内容</th></tr></thead><tbody></tbody>';
  const groups=[['开头：提出观点（1）',1],['主体：对观点进行论述（2）',2],['主体：对观点进行论述（3—4）',2],['主体：对观点进行论述（5—6）',2],['结尾：总结概括（7—8）',2]];let n=0;
  rows[0].before(table);for(const[label,count]of groups){const tr=document.createElement('tr'),a=document.createElement('td'),b=document.createElement('td');a.textContent=label;for(let j=0;j<count;j++)b.append(rows[n++]);tr.append(a,b);table.tBodies[0].append(tr)}
 }
 if(t.orderCards&&!A.querySelector('.order-bank')){
  const selects=[...A.querySelectorAll('[data-blank]')],bank=document.createElement('div'),slots=document.createElement('ol');bank.className='order-bank';slots.className='order-slots';bank.setAttribute('aria-label','点击选项依次排序');
  selects[0].closest('.blank-row').before(bank,slots);selects.forEach(s=>s.closest('.blank-row').hidden=true);
  function draw(){bank.replaceChildren();slots.replaceChildren();const used=selects.map(s=>s.value);for(const item of state.answers[t.id].wordOrder){const b=document.createElement('button');b.textContent=item;b.disabled=used.includes(item);b.onclick=()=>{const target=selects.find(s=>!s.value);if(target){target.value=item;target.dispatchEvent(new Event('change'));draw()}};bank.append(b)}selects.forEach((s,i)=>{const li=document.createElement('li'),b=document.createElement('button');b.textContent=s.value||'点击上方选项放入这里';b.setAttribute('aria-label','第'+(i+1)+'步，点击清空');b.onclick=()=>{s.value='';s.dispatchEvent(new Event('change'));draw()};li.append(b);slots.append(li)})}draw();
 }
}
function legacy(){if(window.HWTTextbookConnection)return;const review=document.querySelector('#review');if(review.hidden||review.querySelector('.legacy-records'))return;const box=document.createElement('section');box.className='legacy-records';box.innerHTML='<h3>旧版记录</h3><p>如以前在本设备使用过旧精读学习单，可单独备份。不会删除或套用到新题。</p><button id="legacyBackup">备份本机旧版记录</button><p id="legacyStatus" role="status"></p>';review.append(box);box.querySelector('button').onclick=()=>{const entries={};for(let i=0;i<localStorage.length;i++){const k=localStorage.key(i);if(/u6l3|jiaxinxi/i.test(k)&&k!==K)entries[k]=localStorage.getItem(k)}if(!Object.keys(entries).length){box.querySelector('#legacyStatus').textContent='本设备未找到旧版记录。其他域名或设备的记录需在原处导出。';return}const a=document.createElement('a');a.href=URL.createObjectURL(new Blob([JSON.stringify({schema:'jiaxinxi-legacy-export-v1',entries},null,2)],{type:'application/json'}));a.download='别上假信息的当_旧版记录.json';a.click();setTimeout(()=>URL.revokeObjectURL(a.href),1000);box.querySelector('#legacyStatus').textContent='旧记录已备份，原记录保留。'}}
const reviewObserver=new MutationObserver(()=>{reviewObserver.disconnect();legacy();reviewObserver.observe(document.querySelector('#review'),{childList:true})});reviewObserver.observe(document.querySelector('#review'),{childList:true});legacy();
const observer=new MutationObserver(()=>{observer.disconnect();enhance();watch()});function watch(){observer.observe(A,{childList:true});observer.observe(S,{childList:true})}enhance();watch();})();

</script></body></html>
